    # deb "Pero... ¿Y [dap]? A ella la besaste... lo cual es lógico, claro..."
    deb "But... And [dap]? You kissed her... which is logical, of course..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1369
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_f7c76ddf:

    # mc "[dap] y yo tenemos una relación especial. Ella acepta que yo salga con otras chicas."
    mc "[dap] and I have a special relationship. She accepts me dating other girls."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1371
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_f3c1d50a:

    # deb "¿Qué? ¿Sales con más chicas?"
    deb "What? Are you dating more girls?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1372
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_3e03845c:

    # mc "Sí, y antes de que me juzgues, debo decirte que todas lo aceptan."
    mc "Yes, and before you judge me, I should tell you that they all accept it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1374
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_313a8454:

    # mc "[dap] y yo tenemos una relación especial. Ella aceptaría que yo saliera con otras chicas."
    mc "[dap] and I have a special relationship. She would accept me dating other girls."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1375
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_ca7e1553:

    # deb "¿No sales con nadie más? Después de lo que dijo Saira ayer..."
    deb "Aren't you seeing anyone else? After what Saira told us yesterday..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1376
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_f6615c63:

    # mc "No, al menos por ahora. Y antes de que me juzgues, debo decirte que, si lo hiciera, todas estarían informadas."
    mc "No, at least for now. And before you judge me, I should tell you that, if I did, they would all be informed."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1378
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_1e041dfc:

    # deb "Eso es lo que me extraña. Que quieras pasar tiempo conmigo en vez de... ¿con tu novia?"
    deb "That's what's so strange for me. That you want to spend time with me instead of... with your girlfriend?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1379
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_437cc117:

    # mc "¿Me estás preguntando si salgo con alguien? *Risa*"
    mc "Are you asking me if I'm dating anyone? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1381
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_58b33f47:

    # mc "Salgo con alguien, y no le importa que pase tiempo con otras chicas. No es celosa... o no demasiado."
    mc "I'm dating someone, and she doesn't mind me spending time with other girls. She's not jealous... or not too jealous."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1383
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_e718535b:

    # mc "Salgo con alguien, con más de una chica, y no les importa que pase tiempo con otras chicas. No son celosas... o no demasiado."
    mc "I am dating someone, well, more than one girl, and they don't mind me spending time with other girls. They're not jealous... or not too jealous."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1385
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_9ee3a46d:

    # deb "¿Qué? ¿Sales con más de una chica?"
    deb "What? Are you dating more than one girl?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1386
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_3e03845c_1:

    # mc "Sí, y antes de que me juzgues, debo decirte que todas lo aceptan."
    mc "Yes, and before you judge me, I should tell you that they all accept it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1388
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_b57a5722:

    # mc "No salgo con nadie ahora mismo. Y aunque lo hiciera, eso no impediría que pasara tiempo con quien quisiera."
    mc "I'm not dating anyone right now. And even if I did, that wouldn't stop me from spending time with whomever I wanted to."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1390
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_47346aa1:

    # deb "¿Ves? A eso me refiero... eres desconcertante... ningún chico ha querido pasar tiempo conmigo..."
    deb "See, that's what I mean... you're baffling... no guy has ever wanted to spend time with me..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1392
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_164ef20d:

    # deb "Por no hablar de besarme..."
    deb "Let alone kiss me..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1393
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_9097ea63:

    # mc "Es posible que los chicos que has encontrado hasta ahora fueran idiotas. No puedo saberlo."
    mc "It's possible that the guys you've met so far were idiots. I don't know."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1395
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_e5438e46:

    # deb "*Risita* También es posible que yo esté viendo cosas donde no las hay."
    deb "*Giggle* It's also possible that I'm seeing things where there isn't anything."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1396
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_e53d216f:

    # "Justo en ese momento, un remolino de aire llega donde estáis y rodea a Debbie de un tornado de pétalos de flores."
    "Just then, a swirl of air arrives where you are and surrounds Debbie in a whirlwind of flower petals."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1399
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_b227959f:

    # deb "¡Qué bonito! *Risa* ¡Es como estar en una película de Disseny!"
    deb "Oh, wow! It's so magical! *Laugh* It's like being in a Disseny movie!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1400
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_84b5c16b:

    # "Ver así a Debbie, con la cara ilusionada intentando cazar unos pétalos que se le escapan entre los dedos cada vez, es un contraste increíble."
    "Seeing Debbie like this, with an elated expression on her face trying to catch petals that slip through her fingers every time, is an incredible contrast."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1401
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_8e9213ec:

    # "Es como ver una niña en el cuerpo de una mujer. Una mujer enorme, pero con la ilusión de una niña."
    "It's like seeing a girl in a woman's body. A very tall woman, but with a little girl's excitement."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1402
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_c046eb09:

    # mc "Ahora mismo eres como una Princesa Disseny. *Risa*"
    mc "Right now, you're like a Disseny Princess. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1403
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_7d99381c:

    # deb "Solo me falta pillar un pétalo, o mejor una flor, y ponérmela en el pelo. *Risa*"
    deb "I just need to pick one petal, or better yet a flower, and put it in my hair. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1404
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_7408f431:

    # "Se te ocurre una idea, quizás sea un poco osada..."
    "You come up with an idea, maybe it's a bit daring..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1421
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_fe833cd9:

    # "Una margarita pasa volando por delante tuyo y la cazas al vuelo."
    "A daisy flies past you and you catch it on the fly."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1422
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_f52661d1:

    # mc "¿Una como esta?"
    mc "A flower like this one?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1423
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_9e3cddaa:

    # "El remolino sigue su camino, llevándose los pétalos y las flores."
    "The whirlwind continues on its way, carrying away the petals and the flowers."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1424
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_4d0a4e9a:

    # deb "Exactamente como esa. Además, justo a tiempo. *Risita*"
    deb "Exactly like that one. Also, just in the nick of time. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1426
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_fad2761f:

    # mc "¿Me permites?"
    mc "May I?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1427
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_a3f20181:

    # deb "Por supuesto... tú la has cazado... para mí... gracias..."
    deb "Of course... you caught it... for me... thank you..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1431
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_bd472ab8:

    # "Una margarita pasa volando por delante suyo y Debbie la caza al vuelo."
    "A daisy flies past her and Debbie catches it on the fly."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1432
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_cf53752c:

    # mc "¿Una como esa?"
    mc "A flower like that one?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1433
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_9e3cddaa_1:

    # "El remolino sigue su camino, llevándose los pétalos y las flores."
    "The whirlwind continues its way, carrying away the petals and the flowers."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1434
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_eb061492:

    # deb "Exactamente como esta. Además, justo a tiempo. *Risita*"
    deb "Exactly like this one. Also, just in the nick of time. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1436
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_6de33996:

    # mc "Te queda muy bien. Ahora eres una auténtica Princesa Disseny."
    mc "It suits you very well. You are now a true Disseny Princess."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1437
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_eaa26fff:

    # deb "Aunque los pétalos ya se han ido."
    deb "Although the petals are gone."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1438
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_249545ca:

    # mc "Ahora solo falta que cantes y que se te pose un pajarillo en el dedo."
    mc "Now you just need to sing and get a bird perched on your finger."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1440
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_64d45b23:

    # deb "*Risa* Mejor no, creo que habría una migración de aves en California si me pongo a cantar. En dirección contraria a mi dedo."
    deb "*Laugh* Better not, I think there would be a bird migration in California if I start singing. In the opposite direction of my finger."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1441
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_60ecec49:

    # mc "No me lo creo. *Risa* ¿Seguimos?"
    mc "*Chuckles* I don't believe it. Shall we continue?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1442
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_cbe3b417:

    # deb "Sí, sigamos hasta el lago. Tengo ganas de bañarme."
    deb "Yes, let's go on to the lake. I feel like taking a dip."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1444
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_a4aca7b8:

    # "El remolino de pétalos ha sido una experiencia bonita, pero ha interrumpido la conversación que estabais teniendo sobre como desconciertas a Debbie."
    "The petal swirl was a nice experience, but it interrupted the conversation you were having about how you baffle Debbie."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1445
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_8d09d5ac:

    # "Con lo tímida que es, va a ser difícil volver a hablar del tema."
    "As shy as she is, it's going to be hard to talk about it again."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1447
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_6ffed3d9:

    # "Unos minutos después, en el lago, una vez os habéis cambiado de ropa cada cual en su arbusto habitual..."
    "A few minutes later, at the lake, once you have changed your clothes in your usual bushes..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1448
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_eb44829e:

    # mc "¿Nos bañamos?"
    mc "Let's take a dip!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1450
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_c4f8f570:

    # deb "Dame un segundo. Quiero guardar la flor."
    deb "Give me a second. I want to stash the flower."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1452
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_d1a22536:

    # deb "Ya está. Así se secará y durará por siempre."
    deb "That's it. This way it will dry and last forever."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1453
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_1c2c2660:

    # mc "¿Llevas un libro cuando sales a correr?"
    mc "Do you carry a book when you go running?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1454
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_9532d122:

    # deb "Estudio Literatura, [mc], y tengo que volver sola. Si encuentro un sitio bonito donde quedarme a leer..."
    deb "I study Literature, [mc], and I have to go back alone. If I find a nice place to stay and read for a while..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1455
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_256ddbd9:

    # mc "Pero es una flor corriente..."
    mc "But it's an ordinary flower..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1457
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_d1a83591:

    # deb "Puede que la flor sea corriente, pero la has cazado tú para mí."
    deb "The flower may be ordinary, but you have caught it for me."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1458
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_42039d98:

    # deb "Verla me recordará siempre el remolino de pétalos y como me pusiste la flor en el pelo."
    deb "Seeing it will always remind me of the magical whirlwind of petals and how you put the flower in my hair."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1459
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_c8be821b:

    # mc "Eso es muy bonito, Debbie."
    mc "That's very sweet, Debbie."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1460
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_df90d381:

    # deb "¡Vamos!"
    deb "Let's go!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1462
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_da61d265:

    # deb "¡No te quedes atrás! *Risa* ¡Sólo tenemos media hora!"
    deb "Don't fall behind! *Laugh* We only have half an hour!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1463
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_d365fdd4:

    # "Otra vez aparece la niña adorable para sustituir a la tímida mujer."
    "Again, the adorable little girl appears to replace the shy woman."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1468
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_ca53953c:

    # deb "El agua está a la temperatura perfecta hoy. Ni muy fría ni muy caliente. Y es tan transparente..."
    deb "The water is the perfect temperature today. Not too cold and not too warm. And it's so clear..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1469
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_36959404:

    # mc "Este lago siempre ha estado muy limpio. Casi nadie sube aquí nunca y los arroyos que lo alimentan bajan muy limpios."
    mc "This lake has always been very clean. Hardly anyone ever comes up here and the streams that feed it are very pure."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1470
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_3bde6d15:

    # mc "Solo está turbio los días después de llover. La lluvia arrastra barro de las laderas, pero en un par de días vuelve a estar transparente."
    mc "It's only murky the days after it rains. The rain washes mud off the slopes, but in a couple of days it's clear again."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1472
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_fbb39a25:

    # deb "Eso me da una idea... ¿has jugado alguna vez a buscar tesoros en este lago? Lisa y yo jugábamos en la playa."
    deb "That gives me an idea... Have you ever played treasure hunting in this lake? Lisa and I used to play it on the beach."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1473
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_1abcb75d:

    # mc "¿Buscar tesoros? No creo que haya nada interesante..."
    mc "Treasure hunting? I don't think there's anything interesting..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1475
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_9a61adeb:

    # deb "Bueno, no consiste en encontrar doblones españoles. *Risa*"
    deb "Well, it's not about finding Spanish doubloons. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1476
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_fa3f1b3d:

    # deb "Consiste en hacer una inmersión buscando cosas en el fondo. El que consiga encontrar la cosa más bonita, valiosa, o rara, gana la ronda."
    deb "It consists of making a dive and looking for things at the lakebed. Whoever manages to find the most beautiful, valuable, or rare thing wins the round."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1477
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_109fa44c:

    # mc "Suena interesante. Nunca he buscado nada aquí. ¡Hagámoslo!"
    mc "Sounds interesting. I've never looked for anything here - let's do it!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1478
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_71f6139d:

    # mc "Pero ¿hay premio para el que gane?"
    mc "But is there a reward for whoever wins?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1480
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_46b767c6:

    # deb "Nunca he jugado por un premio. Siempre he jugado por diversión..."
    deb "I've never played for a reward. I've always played for fun..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1481
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_162e597b:

    # mc "Si estuviera Kate aquí seguro que decía que el que pierde paga prenda. *Risa*"
    mc "If Kate were around, she'd be sure to say loser pays garment. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1484
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_91782b6a:

    # deb "Pero no lo vamos a hacer, ¿verdad? ¿Qué te parece un beso?"
    deb "But we're not going to do it, are we? How about a kiss?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1485
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_094adc07:

    # mc "¿Cómo funcionaría? Un beso es mutuo..."
    mc "How would it work? A kiss is reciprocal..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1486
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_fe902c79:

    # deb "Si tú encuentras el mejor tesoro, te beso yo... si lo encuentro yo, me besas tú..."
    deb "If you find the best treasure, I'll kiss you... if I find it, you'll kiss me..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1487
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_3fb014b0:

    # mc "Es decir, que habrá beso después de cada ronda, ¿no?"
    mc "That means, there will be kissing after each round, right?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1489
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_9dea28d6:

    # deb "A menos que haya empate... *Risita*"
    deb "Unless it's a tie... *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1490
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_62d84d6b:

    # mc "*Risa* A menos que haya empate."
    mc "*Laugh* Unless there is a tie."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1501
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_ffa16180:

    # mc "No sé si me apetece ganar o perder. Pero seguro que no quiero empatar."
    mc "I don't know if I feel like winning or losing. But I sure don't want to draw."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1503
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_aeed3e2c:

    # deb "Te aseguro que estoy en la misma situación. *Risita*"
    deb "I assure you I'm in the same situation. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1504
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_141e4de2:

    # mc "¿Empezamos a jugar? Al mejor de tres."
    mc "Shall we start playing? Best of three."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1506
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_132350b6:

    # mcp "(Me duele hacerte esto, Debbie, pero no puedo dejar que te ilusiones viendo cosas donde no las hay.)"
    mcp "(It pains me to do this to you, Debbie, but I can't let you get your hopes up by seeing things where there aren't any.)"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1507
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_6c54ff70:

    # mc "No me malinterpretes, me gustas, pero creo que esto podría llevar a algo que no deberíamos hacer."
    mc "Don't get me wrong, I like you, but I think this might lead to something we shouldn't do."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1508
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_5d4ff3ad:

    # mc "Me gustas, pero no de ese modo, Debbie, lo siento."
    mc "I like you, but not like that, Debbie, I'm sorry."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1510
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_852ea924:

    # deb "Pero... pero... creo que... tú también me has malinterpretado..."
    deb "But... but... but... I think that... you've misunderstood me too..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1511
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_31a33386:

    # deb "No es que... quiera salir contigo... No. Nada de eso... es solo que... besarte es divertido..."
    deb "It's not that I... want to date you... No. Nothing like that... it's just that... kissing you is fun..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1512
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_95009036:

    # mc "¿Te parece bien si dejamos los besos sólo como buenos días y buenas noches?"
    mc "Is it okay if we leave the kisses as just good morning and good night?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1514
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_d9fbc30c:

    # deb "Ermmm... sí, vale. Así evitaremos... malentendidos..."
    deb "Ermmm... yes, okay. That way we'll avoid... misunderstandings..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1515
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_173875ba:

    # deb "Podríamos jugar por... no sé... El que gane menos rondas le paga una cerveza al otro."
    deb "We could play for... I don't know... Whoever wins the fewest rounds pays the other one a beer."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1516
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_a8f158c9:

    # mc "Me parece genial. Al mejor de tres ¿Empezamos a jugar?"
    mc "Sounds great. Best of three. Shall we start playing?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1518
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_cf7b1fe4:

    # deb "Pero no lo vamos a hacer, ¿verdad? ¿Qué te parece una cerveza? El que gane menos rondas le paga una cerveza al otro."
    deb "But we're not going to do it, are we? How about a beer? Whoever wins the fewest rounds pays the other one a beer."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1519
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_1eb54c01:

    # mc "Me parece genial. ¿Empezamos a jugar? Al mejor de tres."
    mc "Sounds great. Shall we start playing? Best of three."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1521
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_e6504547:

    # "Te sumerges y buscas por el fondo del lago y solo encuentras una piedra con una forma especial antes de que tus pulmones empiecen a pedirte aire."
    "You dive down and search around the bottom of the lake and only find a specially shaped stone before your lungs start to beg for air."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1523
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_00e450f8:

    # "Cuando sacas la cabeza del agua Debbie todavía está sumergida. Como dijo Kim, es como una sirenita. ¿O lo dijiste tú?"
    "When you take your head out of the water Debbie is still submerged. Like Kim said, she's like a little mermaid - or did you say that?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1525
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_551d07df:

    # "Aparece de pronto, como surgida de la nada, esparciendo agua a su alrededor."
    "She appears suddenly, as if out of nowhere, scattering water all around her."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1527
translate english c16s002_RunWithDebbie_367bc4c2:

