# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1945
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_71da2111:

    # eva "He traído unas latas y unos botes. No me gustan las botellas, si llegas a darles no son reutilizables. Además, algún animal se podría cortar con los cristales."
    eva "I brought some cans and plastic bottles. I don't like glass bottles, if you hit them they are not reusable. Besides, some animals might get cut by the glass splinters."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1946
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_1e566a4d:

    # mc "Me gusta descubrir esa faceta de ti, Eva. No me imaginaba que te preocuparan los animales del bosque."
    mc "I like discovering that side of you, Eva. I didn't imagine you cared about forest animals."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1948
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ba2328f7:

    # eva "¿Preocupada por los animales? ¿Yo?"
    eva "Concerned about animals? Me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1949
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a795668c:

    # eva "Es que... si algún animal se hiriese en una pata... mmmm.... dejaría un rastro de sangre... sí, exactamente eso..."
    eva "It's just that... if some animal got wounded in a leg... mmmm... it would leave a trail of blood... yes, exactly that..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1950
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_69dbaf90:

    # eva "Y podría ponérmelo más difícil si alguna vez... no sé... tengo que seguir la pista a uno de mis objetivos a los que haya herido... Sí. Es por eso."
    eva "And it might make it harder for me if I ever... I don't know... have to track down one of my targets that I've wounded... Yes. That's why."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1952
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_51dbdf0d:

    # eva "*Mascullando* Como que uno de mis objetivos iba a poder andar si le disparo..."
    eva "*Mumbling* Like one of my targets would be able to walk if I shot him..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1953
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_5afb7f67:

    # mc "Vale. Fingiré que te creo. *Risa*"
    mc "Okay. I'll pretend to believe you. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1954
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_709983fe:

    # mc "¿Empezamos a disparar?"
    mc "Shall we start shooting?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1956
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_78a959a1:

    # eva "¡No! Primero la clase teórica. Tienes que aprenderte las cinco leyes de las armas de fuego."
    eva "No! First the theory class. You have to learn the five laws of firearms."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1957
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_0afa9162:

    # mc "¿Una clase sobre leyes?"
    mc "A class on law?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1959
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_d1c5adfa:

    # eva "No, idiota. *Risa* Es sobre cómo usar un arma y lo que nunca debes hacer con ella."
    eva "No, you idiot. *Laugh* It's about how to use a gun and what you should never do with it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1960
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_e0ce829f:

    # mc "Ah, vale. ¿Tipo \"nunca mires por el cañón de un arma\" y cosas así?"
    mc "Oh, okay. Like \"never look down the barrel of a gun\", \"the bullets go out the front hole\", and stuff like that?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1961
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7ad5a606:

    # eva "Esa es solo para idiotas. Para ti van a ser las cinco leyes básicas. *Risa* Bueno seis."
    eva "Those are only for idiots. For you, it's going to be the five basic laws. *Laugh* Well six."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1962
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_42ce3c2b:

    # mc "Adelante. Soy todo oídos."
    mc "Go ahead. I'm listening."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1964
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a9dc3613:

    # eva "Uno. Nunca apuntes tu arma a algo a lo que no tengas intención de dispararle."
    eva "One. Never point your gun at something you don't intend to fire at."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1965
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_30aa421a:

    # mc "O lo que es lo mismo, no juegues con ella."
    mc "Or in other words, don't play with it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1966
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_02b71c6e:

    # eva "Exacto. Te sorprendería la cantidad de civiles que os matáis en accidentes idiotas."
    eva "Exactly. You'd be surprised how many civilians kill each other in idiotic accidents."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1967
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_d3381c5a:

    # eva "Dos. No acerques tu dedo al gatillo hasta que estés listo para disparar."
    eva "Two. Don't put your finger near the trigger until you're ready to fire."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1968
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_0c9a95d1:

    # mc "Una buena forma de evitar accidentes."
    mc "A good way to avoid accidents."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1970
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_1ffae699:

    # eva "Las leyes para ti acaban de convertirse en siete."
    eva "The laws for you just became seven."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1972
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_1e5248f2:

    # eva "Tres. Sé consciente de tu objetivo y de lo que hay más allá."
    eva "Three. Be aware of your target and what lies beyond it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1973
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a7be44d7:

    # mc "No te entiendo."
    mc "I don't understand."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1975
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_dcc952f3:

    # eva "Una bala va en línea recta. Realmente no, pero para el ejemplo piensa que sí. Tienes que saber dónde está tu objetivo, pero también que pasa más allá de él."
    eva "A bullet goes in a straight line. It really doesn't but, for this example, let's say it does. You have to know where your target is, but also what's going on beyond it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1976
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_f3af7099:

    # eva "No quieres que, si fallas o la bala atraviesa el objetivo, haya una niña pequeña detrás a la que puedas matar, ¿verdad? O a [dap]. O a mí."
    eva "If you miss or the bullet goes through the target, you don't want to kill the little girl behind it, do you? Or [dap]. Or me."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1977
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_e9602af6:

    # mc "Tienes razón, no se me habría ocurrido nunca. Sigue, por favor."
    mc "You're right, I would never have thought of that. Keep going, please."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1979
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_34b79ed1:

    # eva "Cuatro. Nunca bebas alcohol o consumas drogas antes de disparar o mientras lo haces."
    eva "Four. Never drink alcohol or use drugs before or while firing."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1980
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_6bec7215:

    # mc "Esa tiene lógica."
    mc "That one makes sense."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1981
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_31216bdc:

    # eva "Cinco. Manipula cualquier arma como si estuviera cargada."
    eva "Five. Handle any weapon as if it were loaded."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1982
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_02112f7a:

    # mc "También es lógica."
    mc "That one also makes sense."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1984
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_bdf9310d:

    # eva "Ahora llegan las específicas para ti."
    eva "Now, the specific one's for you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1985
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a250f8e2:

    # mc "¿Algo sobre cómo disparar desde la terraza o algo así?"
    mc "Something about shooting from the terrace or something like that?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1986
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_f362f41f:

    # eva "Seis: Siempre sé puntual cuando quedes con alguien. Especialmente si lo has pedido tú."
    eva "Six: Always be on time when you meet someone. Especially if you asked for it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1987
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a1e21fce:

    # eva "Y más especialmente todavía cuando ese alguien esté armado."
    eva "And even more so when that someone is carrying a gun."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1988
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_e4c61d0d:

    # mc "Eva, lo siento..."
    mc "Eva, I'm sorry..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1990
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ebc8279d:

    # eva "¡Hush!"
    eva "Hush!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1991
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_d0074ed3:

    # eva "Siete: Cuando te esté instruyendo puedes hacer preguntas, pero te puedes ahorrar los comentarios obvios."
    eva "Seven: When I'm instructing you, you can ask questions, but you can spare me the obvious comments."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1993
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_093731fb:

    # eva "Ini bini firmi di ivitir iccidintis..."
    eva "I giid wiy ti iviid iccidints..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1995
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_0cab2a59:

    # eva "Eso sobra. Claro que es por eso. Por eso te estoy enseñando. Pero no puedes estar callado un segundo."
    eva "You can spare me that. Of course that's why! That's why I'm teaching you. But you can't be quiet for a second."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1996
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_2529e0cb:

    # mc "Lo siento, Eva. No quería interrumpirte. Tan solo quería saber la lógica detrás de cada ley."
    mc "I'm sorry, Eva. I didn't mean to interrupt you. I just wanted to know the logic behind each law."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1998
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_267d8b68:

    # eva "Vale. Si tienes dudas, pregunta. No hagas comentarios."
    eva "Okay. If you have questions, ask. Don't comment."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1999
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_55120abd:

    # mc "¡A sus órdenes! *Risa*"
    mc "At your command! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2001
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_0fee774d:

    # eva "*Risa* ¡Y déjate de payasadas! No soy tu superior en rango."
    eva "*Laugh* And stop clowning around! I'm not your superior in rank."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2002
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_68a61123:

    # eva "Vamos a por las armas. Hoy dispararás con pistola y con balas de práctica. Tienen menos potencia y no expulsa el casquillo automáticamente."
    eva "Let's go for the guns. Today you will shoot with a handgun and practice bullets. They have less punch and don't eject the casing automatically."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2003
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_0e592995:

    # eva "Depende de como te vaya, el próximo día puede que te permita disparar con balas de verdad."
    eva "Depending on how you do, the next day I might allow you to shoot with real bullets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2004
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_57d4b6c8:

    # mc "¡Vamos!"
    mc "Let's go!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2006
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_9334e9d2:

    # eva "Esto es una pistola y..."
    eva "This is a semi-automatic pistol and..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2007
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_36c91770:

    # "Eva empieza a darte explicaciones sobre como cogerla, el seguro, la introducción del cargador, y un montón de cosas más."
    "Eva starts to explain how to hold it, the safety lock, the insertion of the magazine, and a lot of other things."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2008
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_d81891fb:

    # "Siempre con la recámara vacía y el cargador extraído. Eva pone mucho énfasis en la seguridad y te va repitiendo las leyes hasta que puedes recitarlas de memoria."
    "Always with the chamber empty and the magazine removed. Eva puts a lot of emphasis on safety and repeats the laws until you can recite them by heart."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2010
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_8f989143:

    # eva "Vale, eso es lo más básico. Otro día te enseñaré a desmontar y limpiar tu arma. Vamos a lo divertido. Casi estás listo para tu primer disparo."
    eva "Okay, that's the basics. Another day I'll teach you how to disassemble and clean your weapon. Let's get to the fun stuff. You're almost ready for your first shot."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2011
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_c95a51fc:

    # mc "Eso, desde luego, suena más divertido que la teoría."
    mc "That certainly sounds more fun than the theory."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2012
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_49b1896a:

    # eva "Ponte en posición para disparar. Coge el arma con las dos manos y apunta a una lata. Dedo fuera del gatillo."
    eva "Get in position to shoot. Hold the gun with two hands and aim at a can. Finger off the trigger."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2014
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_1e9e90ba:

    # "Te pones en tu mejor imitación de las poses que usan los actores en las películas."
    "You strike your best imitation of the poses that actors use in movies."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2015
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_6d27e1bc:

    # "Pies separados y las rodillas un poco flexionadas. Lo has visto tantas veces en las películas que casi parece una postura natural."
    "Feet apart and knees slightly bent. You've seen it so many times in the movies that it almost seems like a natural posture. It looks like you are farting."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2017
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_1d1a89a9:

    # eva "Casi bien. Para un civil. Énfasis en casi. En esa postura no le darás ni a un elefante. No es que el elefante tenga la culpa, claro."
    eva "Almost fine. For a civilian. Emphasis on almost. In that posture, you won't even hit an elephant. And the elephant isn't the one to blame, of course."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2018
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_c22a84a4:

    # mc "¿Qué estoy haciendo mal?"
    mc "What am I doing wrong?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2020
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7fa6dd90:

    # eva "Esto. Los pies."
    eva "This. Feet pose."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2021
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_091cbf26:

    # "Eva da un golpe seco en el cañón del arma descargada que te desequilibra."
    "Eva delivers a sharp blow on the barrel of the unloaded gun that knocks you off balance."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2023
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_2fbb26e9:

    # eva "Tal como tienes los pies, paralelos al arma y entre sí, el retroceso hará que pierdas el equilibrio."
    eva "The way you planted your feet, parallel to the gun and to each other, the recoil will cause you to lose your balance."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2024
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_6c79fc2e:

    # eva "Solo ha sido un pequeño empujón, menor que el que te dará la munición de práctica. El arma te dará una pequeña coz cuando uses munición de verdad."
    eva "It was just a little nudge, less than what you'll get from practice ammo. The gun will give you a little kick when you use real ammo."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2025
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7b63615a:

    # eva "Y esta es solo una 9mm. Si disparas con una .45 será peor. Te caerías de culo encima de esa roca."
    eva "And this is only a 9mm. If you shoot with a .45 ACP it will be worse. You'd fall on your ass on top of that rock."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2026
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_6eba0262:

    # eva "Vuelve a ponerte en la misma posición."
    eva "Go back to the same position."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2028
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_8e36ee80:

    # eva "¿Ves? Este pie lo tienes bien. Apuntando al objetivo."
    eva "See, you got this foot right. Aiming for the target."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2030
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_4c718521:

    # eva "Este muévelo un poco hacia atrás y gíralo. 45 o 60° respecto al otro, lo que te sea más cómodo."
    eva "Move this one back a little bit and rotate it. 45 or 60° relative to the other one, whichever is more comfortable for you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2032
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_4d0846ed:

    # eva "Así mucho mejor. Ahora que sabes la teoría busca una posición cómoda para ti."
    eva "That's much better. Now that you know the theory, find a comfortable position for yourself."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2034
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_16ecc6ac:

    # eva "¿Ves? Mucho más firme y equilibrado."
    eva "See? A lot firmer and more balanced."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2035
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_d73d1ed7:

    # mc "Sí, tienes razón. Pero he visto en muchas películas que se ponen así."
    mc "Yes, you're right. But I've seen the actors pose like that in a lot of movies."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2037
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7ecf0af1:

    # eva "Nunca te fíes de lo que ves en las películas. Y menos aún en lo referido a las armas."
    eva "Never trust what you see in the movies. And even less so when it comes to weapons."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2038
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_fe2d5191:

    # eva "Yo crecí pensando que todo el mundo tenía armas y vivía en casas enormes en Estados Unidos. Y que las calles estarían llenas de Brad Pits y Charlize Terons."
    eva "I grew up thinking that everyone had guns and lived in huge houses in the US. And that the streets would be full of Brad Pits and Charlize Terons."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2039
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a02d352a:

    # mc "Y la realidad te debió decepcionar un poco. Por cierto, Charlize es sudafricana."
    mc "And the reality must have disappointed you a bit. By the way, Charlize is South African."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2041
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a3ad98b6:

    # eva "Lo sé, pero no lo sabía entonces. Hasta que no estudiamos acentos y dialectos no lo supe."
    eva "I know, but I didn't know it then. Until we studied accents and dialects I didn't discover it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2042
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_0fc8bc3f:

    # mc "¿Acentos y dialectos?"
    mc "Accents and dialects?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2044
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ef782ed4:

    # eva "Soy capaz de hablar 17 idiomas, y usar localismos en varios de ellos. Mientras tu jugabas a la Play, nuestros juegos eran hablar en Árabe, con acento de Libia o de Yemen."
    eva "I can speak 17 languages and use localisms in several of them. While you were playing videogames, we played at speaking in Arabic, trying to catch a Libyan or Yemeni accent."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2045
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ec601d26:

    # mc "Tiene que haber sido difícil."
    mc "It must have been hard."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2047
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_574806c6:

    # eva "No lo era. No conocíamos nada más, para nosotras era normal. Lo echábamos de menos tanto como echas tú de menos ser Spiderman."
    eva "It wasn't. We didn't know anything else, for us it was normal. We missed it as much as you missed being Spiderman."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2048
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_870ff905:

    # eva "Lo que veíamos en la TV no existía. Era ciencia ficción para nosotras. Las niñas no disparaban y no morían en la TV."
    eva "What we saw on TV did not exist. It was science fiction to us. Girls didn't shoot or die on TV."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2050
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_b146110d:

    # eva "Pero dejemos de hablar de nosotras. Carga el arma y mete una bala en la recámara."
    eva "But let's stop talking about us. Insert the magazine and load a cartridge in the chamber."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2051
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_984f4a1a:

    # eva "Dedo lejos del gatillo. Sin apuntar en mi dirección o en la de tus pies."
    eva "Finger away from the trigger. No aiming in my direction or at your feet."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2052
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_8f911973:

    # mc "¡A sus órdenes!"
    mc "At your command!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2054
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_b9e3210a:

    # eva "Ahora apunta con una mano y dispara a la lata que menos te guste."
    eva "Now aim with one hand and shoot the can you like the least."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2055
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_b1a93e78:

    # eva "Recuerda. Vas a disparar con munición de práctica. No expulsa el casquillo y no recarga automáticamente. Tienes que amartillarla manualmente."
    eva "Remember. You're going to fire with practice ammo. It doesn't eject the casing and it doesn't automatically reload. You have to cock it manually."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2056
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a645c1e2:

    # mc "Será mejor que te apartes, ¿no?"
    mc "You'd better step aside, right?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2057
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_4d2f0adf:

    # eva "No te preocupes. No me puedes dar aquí. Mi instructor se pondría detrás tuyo, con su arma apuntando a tu cabeza, pero yo prefiero estar aquí. Dispara tres veces."
    eva "Don't worry. You can't hit me here. My instructor would stand behind you, with his gun pointed at your head, but I'd rather be here. Shoot three times."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2059
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ee71ee81:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2060
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_25a15966:

    # "No tienes ni idea de dónde va el primer disparo. La pequeña coz de la que ha hablado Eva es más fuerte de lo que esperabas y el retroceso ha hecho que el cañón se levante."
    "You have no idea where the first shot goes. The little kick Eva talked about is stronger than you expected and the recoil caused the barrel to rise."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2061
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_697265d2:

    # eva "Ningún pato muerto de momento. Las latas están mucho más abajo. *Risa* Otra vez."
    eva "No dead ducks so far. The cans are much lower. *Laugh* Again."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2062
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_d9fcd1cc:

    # eva "Por cierto, pareces salido del Doomfenstein cogiendo la pistola así. *Risa*"
    eva "By the way, you look like you're straight out of Doomfenstein picking up the gun like that. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2064
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a37b6d3e:

    # mcp "(No me importaría disparar a Eric en un videojuego.)"
    mcp "(I wouldn't mind shooting Eric in a video game.)"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2066
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ee71ee81_1:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2067
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_c819ef3f:

    # "Esta vez el retroceso no te sorprende y eres capaz de controlarlo. Esta vez sí que ves donde impacta la bala. En el árbol que hay detras del bote al que apuntabas."
    "This time the recoil doesn't surprise you and you are able to control it. You see where the bullet hits. High in the tree behind the bottle you were aiming at."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2068
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_2da7ca91:

    # eva "Nos vamos acercando. Si el bote devolviera el fuego, ya estarías muerto. Porque estás apuntando al bote, ¿verdad? *Risa* Al menos no has matado ninguna ardilla."
    eva "We are getting closer. If the bottle returned fire, you'd be dead by now. Because you're aiming at the bottle, aren't you? *Laugh* At least you didn't kill any squirrels."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2070
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ee71ee81_2:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2071
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_50a5cf56:

    # "Intentas compensar más todavía el retroceso. Esta vez levantas un poco de polvo delante de la lata. Lo has compensado en exceso, pero la dirección era buena."
    "You try to compensate even more for the recoil. This time you raise a little dust cloud in front of the bottle. You overcompensated, but the aiming was almost right."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2072
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_95d2920f:

    # eva "¡Ese ha sido casi bueno! Hay un topo teniendo un ataque de ansiedad ahora mismo. *Risa* Pero ha sido el mejor disparo."
    eva "That was almost a good one! A mole is having an anxiety attack right now. *Laugh* But it was your best attempt."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2074
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_886f2a3d:

    # eva "Saca la bala de la recámara, ponle el seguro, saca el cargador, y dame el arma."
    eva "Take the casing out of the chamber, put the safety lock, remove the magazine, and give me the gun."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2075
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_8cc59136:

    # mc "Es más difícil de lo que parece. En las películas lo pillan en seguida."
    mc "It's harder than it looks. In the movies they catch on right away."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2076
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_dbc49818:

    # eva "¿Qué te he dicho sobre Spiderman hace un rato? No te creas nada de lo que veas en una película."
    eva "What did I tell you about Spiderman earlier? Don't believe anything you see in a movie."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2077
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_8fb1373c:

    # eva "Si esto fuera una película habrías acertado a la primera y estaríamos follando contra un árbol."
    eva "If this were a movie you would have gotten it right the first time and we'd be fucking against a tree."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2078
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_1c09825e:

    # mc "*Risa* Antes me vas a tener que invitar a cenar. *Risa*"
    mc "*Laugh* You're going to have to take me out to dinner first. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2080
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_3ae0c5f5:

    # eva "Tú crees que eres gracioso, ¿verdad? No hace falta que contestes."
    eva "You think you're funny, don't you? You don't need to answer."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2081
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_83ba66b2:

    # eva "Tu problema es que tiras del gatillo."
    eva "Your problem is that you pull the trigger."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2082
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7e0d352a:

    # mc "Eso es lo que hay que hacer, ¿no? Si no, no dispara."
    mc "That's how it works, isn't it? Without pulling the trigger, it doesn't fire."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2083
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_4d2a88ea:

    # eva "No, si tiras del gatillo estás desequilibrando el arma. Hacia abajo, como ahora. Eso si eres capaz de controlar el retroceso, que lo estás empezando a hacer bien."
    eva "No, if you pull the trigger, you are unbalancing the gun. Downward, just like now. That's if you're able to control the recoil, which you're starting to do right."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2084
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_61279e7e:

    # eva "Lo que tienes que hacer es estrujar con toda la mano. Empuñadura y gatillo. Como si fuera una pelota antiestrés. ¿Ves?"
    eva "What you have to do is squeeze with your whole hand. Grip and trigger. Like a stress ball. See?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2085
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_c97c5a04:

    # mc "Vale, lo veo. Déjame probar otra vez"
    mc "Okay, I see. Let me try again."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2087
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ee71ee81_3:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2088
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_49e3887e:

    # "La teoría de estrujar empuñadura y gatillo a la vez es fácil. La práctica no."
    "The theory of squeezing grip and trigger at the same time is easy. The practice is not."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2089
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_c55629c2:

    # eva "Casi. El topo acaba de reservar unas vacaciones en Florida. *Risa* Prefiere los caimanes. Controla un poco más como estrujas el conjunto y casi lo tendrás."
    eva "Almost. The mole just booked a vacation in Florida. *Laugh* He prefers alligators. Control a little better how you squeeze the whole thing and you'll almost have it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2091
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ee71ee81_4:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2092
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_261480da:

    # "Esta vez sí que impactas en el bote. La sensación de alegría es inmensa."
    "This time you hit the bottle. The feeling of joy is immense."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2093
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_01891b38:

    # mc "¡Sí!"
    mc "Yes!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2094
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_9f9ce441:

    # eva "¡Muy bien, [mc]! Un último disparo para comprobar que no ha sido casualidad."
    eva "All right, [mc]! One last shot to prove it wasn't a fluke."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2096
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ee71ee81_5:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2097
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_9aa56c1a:

    # "La lata salta por los aires. ¡Estás aprendiendo a disparar!"
    "The can jumps through the air - you're learning to shoot!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2098
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_65608ae9:

    # eva "¡Genial!"
    eva "Great!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2099
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_d11b853e:

    # eva "Te quedan 11 balas y cuatro objetivos. A ver cuántos puedes derribar."
    eva "You have eleven bullets and four targets left. Let's see how many you can take down."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2101
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_61d2f1fa:

    # "*Bang* *Bang* *Bang*"
    "*Bang* *Bang* *Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2102
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_2dd5869c:

    # "Disparas tres veces a la botella de gel de manos. No hay suerte. Dirías que le has dado, pero no ha saltado por los aires. Ocho balas. Cuatro objetivos todavía."
    "You shoot three times at the bottle of hand sanitizer. No luck. You'd say you hit it, but it didn't go airborne. Eight bullets. Four targets still."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2103
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_f27f9b21:

    # eva "Esa botella no quiere morir. *Risa*"
    eva "That bottle doesn't want to die. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2105
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_54c88ec6:

    # "*Bang* *Bang*"
    "*Bang* *Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2106
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_dfb9a365:

    # "La siguiente lata salta volando al segundo disparo. Seis balas. Tres objetivos."
    "The next can flies away on the second shot. Six bullets. Three targets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2107
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ab282110:

    # eva "¡Muy bien!"
    eva "Good!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2109
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ee71ee81_6:

    # "*Bang*"
    "*Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2110
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_71cea6f0:

    # "La siguiente al primero. Cinco balas. Dos objetivos."
    "The next can flies with the first shot. Five bullets. Two targets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2111
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_21c9233d:

    # eva "¡Alucinante!"
    eva "Amazing!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2112
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_2a0ec6bb:

    # "Cambias de objetivo."
    "You change targets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2114
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_61d2f1fa_1:

    # "*Bang* *Bang* *Bang*"
    "*Bang* *Bang* *Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2115
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_c6603222:

    # "Te cuesta tres balas acabar con la siguiente lata. Últimas dos balas. Solo queda la botella de gel de manos."
    "It costs you three bullets to finish the next can. Last two bullets. Only the bottle of hand sanitizer is left."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2116
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_f3699c6d:

    # eva "Esa se ha resistido, pero bien. A por la última."
    eva "That one was dodging the bullets. *Laugh* But fine. Go to the last one."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2118
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_54c88ec6_1:

    # "*Bang* *Bang*"
    "*Bang* *Bang*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2119
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_16e68d53:

    # "Vuelves a la botella. Disparas. Volverías a jurar que le has dado, pero la botella sigue ahí. No has fallado porque sea transparente, ¿verdad?"
    "You go back to the bottle. You shoot. You'd swear you hit it again, but the bottle is still there. You didn't miss it because it's transparent, did you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2121
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_785266c5:

    # eva "Muy bien, [mc]."
    eva "Very well, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2122
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_4e17dc40:

    # mc "Muy bien no. La botella se ha resistido."
    mc "Not very well. The bottle has survived."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2123
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_84d67cbf:

    # eva "¿Estás seguro? Ve a verla."
    eva "Are you sure? Go check it out."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2125
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_a3d8938e:

    # mc "¿Has clavado la botella al suelo? *Risa*"
    mc "Did you nail the bottle to the ground? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2127
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_485a1eef:

    # eva "*Risa* ¡Sí! Ha sido divertido ver cómo te frustrabas. Se me saltan las lágrimas."
    eva "*Laugh* Yes! It was fun watching you get frustrated. I'm crying from holding in my laughter."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2128
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_11f2057b:

    # mc "Muy graciosa... *Risa*"
    mc "You think you're funny? ... *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2129
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_5449829a:

    # mc "Pero no sé cuántas veces le he dado. No sé ni cuántas le he disparado..."
    mc "But I don't know how many times I've hit it. I don't even know how many times I shot it..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2131
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_3a0f7938:

    # eva "Le has disparado cinco veces y le has dado dos. No está nada mal para tu primera vez. 17 balas y siete aciertos."
    eva "You shot at it five times and hit it twice. Not bad for your first time. 17 bullets and seven hits."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2132
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_90d53fbc:

    # eva "Mi primera vez fue bastante peor. Y fui la mejor de todas."
    eva "My first time was much worse. And I was the best of the bunch."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2134
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_6ef6c4c4:

    # eva "Sí, lo sé Amanda, conseguí la misma puntuación que tú, pero más dieces."
    eva "Yeah, I know Amanda, I got the same score as you, but more perfect shots."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2135
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_feb7a9e4:

    # mc "¿Qué edad tenías?"
    mc "How old were you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2137
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7316c5b5:

    # eva "6 años. Aquellas pistolas fueron nuestro regalo de cumpleaños."
    eva "Six years old. Those guns were our birthday present."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2138
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ee6d7077:

    # mc "Eso es muy triste. ¿Ni una muñeca? ¿Ni un juguete?"
    mc "That's very sad. Not even a doll? Not a toy?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2140
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_61687f98:

    # eva "Es tan triste como que a ti nunca te regalaran un sable laser que funcionara."
    eva "It's as sad as you never getting a working lightsaber."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2141
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_61df8865:

    # mc "No existen, Eva."
    mc "They don't exist, Eva."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2143
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_307d9685:

    # eva "Igual que en nuestro mundo no existían juguetes o muñecas."
    eva "Just as, in our world, no toys or dolls existed."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2144
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_dc077a5f:

    # eva "Nuestros juguetes eran armas y dispositivos de vigilancia. Era lo normal. Y espiarnos entre nosotras era divertido."
    eva "Our toys were weapons and surveillance devices. It was what it was. And spying on each other was fun."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2145
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_8944a074:

    # eva "Con el tiempo, los A nos empezaron a traer cosas de sus misiones. Bolas de nieve y cosas así."
    eva "Eventually, the A's started bringing us things from their missions. Snow globes and things like that."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2146
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_d46f30be:

    # eva "Era casi como sentirse en una película. Eran casi como nuestros tíos favoritos."
    eva "It was almost like being in a movie. They were like our favorite uncles."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2147
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7e47bbdd:

    # mc "Joder, Eva. ¿Puedo abrazarte?"
    mc "Fuck, Eva, can I hug you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2149
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7a266f30:

    # eva "{b}¿Qué? ¿A mí? ¿Por qué?{/b}"
    eva "{b}What? Me? Why? {/b}"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2150
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_5a9dce8e:

    # mc "*Risa* Costumbre familiar. Cuando alguien explica algo triste, nos abrazamos. Nos consolamos."
    mc "*Laugh* Family tradition. When someone tells us something sad, we hug. We comfort each other."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2152
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_5df147c8:

    # eva "¿Te ha puesto triste?"
    eva "Did I make you sad?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2153
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_65178f3d:

    # mc "Me pone triste que no hayas tenido una infancia normal."
    mc "It makes me sad that you didn't have a normal childhood."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2154
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_dc77e864:

    # eva "No tienes que ponerte triste por eso. Para mí... para nosotras, era normal. No echábamos nada de menos."
    eva "You don't have to be sad about it. For me... for us, it was normal. We didn't miss anything."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2155
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_3c24a76c:

    # mc "¿Estás intentando consolarme? ¿Tú a mí?"
    mc "Are you trying to comfort me? You? Me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2157
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_66f22b48:

    # eva "En eso consiste, ¿no? Has dicho que cuando algo os pone tristes, os consoláis. ¿O lo he entendido mal?"
    eva "That's what it is, isn't it? You said that when something makes you sad, you console each other. Or did I misunderstand?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2158
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_0d0f1f21:

    # mc "No, lo has entendido perfectamente."
    mc "No, you understood it perfectly."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2160
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_18706471:

    # "Vuelves a abrazarla. Ya no sabes si para consolarla a ella o a ti mismo. Ella parece no necesitar consuelo, pero ayer demostró que necesita cariño."
    "You hug her again. You no longer know whether to comfort her or yourself. She doesn't seem to need comforting, but yesterday she showed that she needs affection."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2161
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_8a720530:

    # mcp "(¡Qué difícil va a ser esto! Ni siquiera entiende lo triste que es su situación.)"
    mcp "(How hard this is going to be! She doesn't even understand how sad her situation is.)"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2162
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_5a621af3:

    # eva "Si este es el premio por ponerte triste, tengo un montón de historias para contar."
    eva "If this is the reward for making you sad, I have a lot of stories to tell."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2163
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_512d67f8:

    # mc "Las quiero oír todas, Eva."
    mc "I want to hear them all, Eva."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2164
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_6822f159:

    # mc "Y en casa también querrán hacerlo. Prepárate para muchos abrazos."
    mc "And at home they'll want to hear them too. Be prepared for lots of hugs."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2166
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_e14b574a:

    # eva "¡Oh, mierda! ¿Qué hora es? ¿A qué hora me esperan para comer?"
    eva "Oh, shit! What time is it? What time am I supposed to be there for lunch?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2167
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_0f00cee4:

    # mc "A la una y media. No sé qué hora es. Tengo el móvil en la mochila."
    mc "At half past one. I don't know what time it is. I have my cell phone in my backpack."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2169
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_59346b24:

    # eva "Por eso llegas tarde a los sitios. *Risa* Vamos a recoger las latas y empecemos a bajar. A mí no me gusta llegar tarde."
    eva "That's why you're late to places. *Laugh* Let's pick up the cans and start going back home. I don't like being late."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2170
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_02e83dae:

    # mc "¿Cuánto tiempo me lo vas a echar en cara?"
    mc "How long are you going to hold it against me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2171
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_9cc61597:

    # eva "Hasta que llegues puntual. *Risita*"
    eva "Until you are on time. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2173
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_db5b72df:

    # "Recogéis el campo de tiro. Eva hace hincapié en no dejaros ningún casquillo. Las balas son irrecuperables en su mayoría."
    "You clean up the range. Eva stresses not to leave any casings behind. Most of the bullets are unrecoverable."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2174
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_339de07e:

    # "Se hace una cola y empezáis a bajar hacia casa. Ella es mucho más rápida y ágil que tú. También tiene más prisa. Ni una gota de sudor perla su frente."
    "She pulls her hair into a ponytail, and you start to head down toward home. She is much faster and more agile than you. She's also in a hurry. Not a drop of sweat glistens on her forehead."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2176
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_46540fd2:

    # eva "Venga, tortuguilla. Vamos a llegar tarde por tu culpa."
    eva "Come on, you little turtle. We're going to be late because of you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2177
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_238c4bb3:

    # mc "Hay tiempo de sobra, Eva."
    mc "There's plenty of time, Eva."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2178
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_6362713e:

    # eva "No tanto. Me tengo que cambiar de ropa. No quiero que la primera impresión que tenga la familia de mí sea vestida así."
    eva "Not so much. I have to change my clothes. I don't want the family's first impression of me to be dressed like this."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2179
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_6c9962db:

    # mc "¿Por eso te has hecho la coleta?"
    mc "Is that why you put up the ponytail?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2181
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_fb1c88a0:

    # eva "Tengo más pinta de buena chica con ella, ¿no? *Risita*"
    eva "I look more like a good girl with it, don't I? *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2182
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_aae332f6:

    # mc "Eva, la primera impresión que se van a llevar es que eres una buena chica. Porque lo eres."
    mc "Eva, the first impression they're going to get is that you're a good girl. Because you are."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2183
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_7bc3e73a:

    # mc "Ahora vas a decirme que llevas un vestido en la mochila."
    mc "Now you're going to tell me you're packing a dress in your backpack."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2185
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_ce4ddcbd:

    # eva "¿Un vestido? ¿Qué tiene de malo un vestido? ¿No sería apropiado?"
    eva "A dress? What's wrong with a dress? Wouldn't it be appropriate?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2186
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_40705795:

