translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_c0579bb2:

    # eva "Dime."
    eva "Tell me."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2465
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_feab26bb:

    # mc "¿Cómo lo llevas? ¿Te estamos agobiando mucho?"
    mc "How are you coping? Are we stressing you out too much?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2466
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_c9f22343:

    # eva "Más que agobiando, abrumando un poco. Pero todo está bien. Raro, pero bien."
    eva "More than stressing out, only a bit overwhelming. But it's all good. Weird, but good."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2467
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fda0182f:

    # mc "Voy a dejarte un momento en sus manos. Me acaban de decir que apesto un poco y voy a darme una ducha y a cambiarme."
    mc "I'm going to leave you in their hands for a moment. [mar] just told me I stink a little and I'm going to take a shower and change."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2469
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_9401856e:

    # eva "¿No vas a quedarte a comer?"
    eva "Won't you stay for lunch?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2470
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8dd9ea08:

    # mc "Sí, va a ser una ducha rápida y vuelvo en un momento. ¿Estarás bien?"
    mc "Yeah, it's going to be a quick shower and I'll be back in a bit. Will you be okay?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2472
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d97b00b1:

    # eva "C-creo que sí... creo que estaba más preocupada de lo necesario."
    eva "I-I think so... I think I was more worried than I needed to be."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2473
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_b7c8d2a4:

    # mc "Si necesitas algún plan de extracción, habla con [mar] o [nor]. Ellas te ayudarán."
    mc "If you need any extraction plan, talk to [mar] or [nor]. They will help you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2475
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ca7d62e0:

    # eva "¡Gracias!"
    eva "Thanks!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2476
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_7b1f4816:

    # mc "¡Hey! ¿A qué viene ese abrazo?"
    mc "Hey, why the hug?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2478
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_92824df2:

    # eva "Costumbres familiares, dijiste. Me pone triste haber sido tan tonta. Haberte prejuzgado..."
    eva "Family habits, you said. It makes me sad to have been so foolish. To have prejudged you..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2479
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_176fdc2a:

    # eva "No eres manipulador, solo un idiota que no sabe que no debe preocuparse tanto por las chicas de la familia. Sabemos... saben cuidarse solas."
    eva "You're not manipulative, just an idiot who doesn't know not to worry so much about the family girls. We know... they know how to take care of themselves."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2480
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fca1fa8c:

    # mc "¿Acabas de decir \"sabemos\"? *Risa*"
    mc "Did you just say \"We know\"? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2482
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_92380e41:

    # eva "¡Joder! Hacéis muy difícil no sentirse aceptada. Me han dicho \"bienvenida a la familia\" quince veces en cinco minutos."
    eva "Fuck! You guys make it so hard not to feel accepted. I've been told \"Welcome to the family\" fifteen times in five minutes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2483
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_e0f693e3:

    # mc "Ya te lo dije. Ahora solo hace falta que te lo termines de creer."
    mc "I told you so. Now all you need to do is believe it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2485
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3babefea:

    # "Eva te abraza un poco más fuerte durante un segundo, apoyando su cabeza contra tu cuello."
    "Eva hugs you a little tighter for a second, resting her head against your neck."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2486
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_77a2abd6:

    # eva "Bueno, vete ya. Al final tu peste se me va a pegar a la ropa."
    eva "Well, go now. Or, in the end, your stench is going to stick to my clothes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2487
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ff158c35:

    # mc "Bonita forma de decir que prefieres estar con las chicas a estar conmigo. *Risa*"
    mc "Nice way of saying you'd rather be with girls than be with me. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2488
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_241ddbc7:

    # mc "Vuelvo en un rato. No dejes que te agobien demasiado."
    mc "I'll be back in a bit. Don't let them bother you too much."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2490
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_7fabacc8:

    # mc "Hola, Saira. Hola, Kate. ¿Habéis comido ya?"
    mc "Hi, Saira, Kate, have you had lunch yet?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2491
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5b29a970:

    # sai "Sí, Lisa y Kim tenían clase esta tarde y hemos comido todas juntas antes de que se fueran."
    sai "Yes, Lisa and Kim had lessons this afternoon and we all had lunch together before they left."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2492
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5c9c51b9:

    # kat "Después de tener La Conversación. Por cierto, una oportunidad perdida de llamarla... *Voz profunda* \"La Clonversación\". *Risa*"
    kat "After having The Conversation. By the way, a missed opportunity to call it.... *Deep voice* \"The Cloneversation\". *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2493
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5e013d06:

    # mc "*Risa* No se me había ocurrido"
    mc "*Laugh* I hadn't thought of that."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2494
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3df6fa10:

    # mc "¿No vais a ir a la comida con Eva?"
    mc "Aren't you going to the lunch with Eva?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2496
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a194e8af:

    # kat "[mar] nos ha dicho que fuéramos, pero hemos pensado que era mejor dejaros un rato en familia. Pasaremos luego a conocerla."
    kat "[mar] told us to go, but we thought it would be better to leave her with the family for a while. We'll stop by later to meet her."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2497
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5f367032:

    # sai "Y tú deberías estar allí, ¿no?"
    sai "And you should be there, shouldn't you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2498
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_98e156c0:

    # mc "Voy a ducharme y a cambiarme."
    mc "I'm going to shower and change clothes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2500
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_85b0831c:

    # sai "No te entretenemos más entonces. Por cierto, buenos días."
    sai "We won't keep you any longer then. By the way, good morning."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2501
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_35324926:

    # mc "Buenos días, Saira. *Risa*"
    mc "Good morning, Saira. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2502
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3e841c14:

    # mc "Luego tengo que hablar contigo."
    mc "I need to talk to you later."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2503
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ea965c45:

    # sai "OK."
    sai "OK."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2506
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_741044eb:

    # kat "Buenos días, [mc]."
    kat "Good morning, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2507
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f5d23c52:

    # mc "Buenos días, Kate."
    mc "Good morning, Kate."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2509
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d4eeb63f:

    # kat "Vete a duchar antes de que nos aromatizes la planta con Eau de Sobac. *Risa* ¡Apestas!"
    kat "Go take a shower before you flavor our floor with Eau d'Armpit. *Laugh* You reek!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2510
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_597d90d7:

    # sai "¡Es verdad! *Risa* Yo notaba un olor conocido y no lo localizaba."
    sai "It's true! *Laugh* I noticed a familiar stench and couldn't locate it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2511
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_74cf13bd:

    # mc "A lo mejor es por la costumbre de Kate de ir descalza. *Risa* Eau de Rochefort."
    mc "Maybe it's because of Kate's habit of going barefoot. *Laugh* Eau de Rochefort."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2512
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_4c4d2b0d:

    # mc "Me voy antes de que empecéis a deprimirme. *Risa*"
    mc "I'm leaving before you guys start depressing me. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2514
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_4923eed1:

    # "Vuelves a la cocina de [nor] después de ducharte y, tal como te imaginabas, Eva es el centro de atención de las chicas. Las mujeres se mantienen apartadas, hablando entre ellas."
    "You return to [nor]'s kitchen after showering and, just as you imagined, Eva is the center of the girls' attention. The women stand apart, talking to each other."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2515
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_6e78f223:

    # eva "... y entonces Amanda me avisó por radio y..."
    eva "... and then Amanda radioed me and..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2517
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ad2c1764:

    # eva "Ya ha vuelto la mofeta. *Risa*"
    eva "The skunk is back. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2518
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_b3b94564:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2519
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_c0c00b97:

    # mc "Parece que ya te estás integrando en la familia. *Risa* El deporte familiar es reírse de mí."
    mc "It looks like you're already integrating into the family. *Laugh* The family sport is to laugh at me."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2520
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_c8490af3:

    # emm "Porque te lo mereces. Siempre haces algo para que nos riamos contigo y de ti."
    emm "Because you deserve it. You always do something to make us laugh with you and at you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2521
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_220d4b3f:

    # eri "No como tú, ¿verdad, [emm]? *Risa*"
    eri "Not like you, right, [emm]? *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2522
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f758be34:

    # dap "Al menos él lo suele hacer a propósito. *Risa*"
    dap "At least he usually does it on purpose. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2523
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_46ca4104:

    # sca "*Risa* Y nadie le suele prohibir ningún color."
    sca "*Laugh* And no one usually forbids him any color."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2525
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_13a76ecd:

    # emm "Ni siquiera en mi cumpleaños me vais a dejar tranquila, ¿verdad?"
    emm "You're not even going to spare me on my birthday, are you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2526
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_962e612f:

    # mc "Elige. No nos reímos de ti hoy o el domingo."
    mc "You have to Choose. We're not laughing at you today or on Sunday?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2527
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_e64c798e:

    # emm "*Gruñido* El domingo. Es el cumpleaños de verdad."
    emm "*Grunt* On Sunday. It's the real birthday."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2528
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_b3b94564_1:

    # todas "*Risa*"
    todas "*Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2530
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8024e8af:

    # mom "Ve a comer algo. Es tarde y todo el mundo estaba hambriento. Si [nor] y yo no llegamos a intervenir no te hubieran dejado nada."
    mom "Go get something to eat. It's late and everyone was hungry. If [nor] and I didn't step in they wouldn't have left you anything."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2531
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a935706d:

    # mc "Gracias, [mar.mc!t]."
    mc "Thanks, [mar.mc!t]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2532
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5f6e293a:

    # mom "Te he dejado un plato con pato, salmon, rollitos, carne con gambas, y falafel al lado del fregadero. No sabíamos que le gustaría a Eva."
    mom "I left you a plate with duck, salmon, rolls, meat with shrimp, and falafel by the sink. We didn't know what Eva would like, and we cooked something assorted."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2534
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0678140b:

    # "Ver esta reunión y cómo Eva se siente más cómoda de lo que nunca hubiera pensado te llena de alegría de alguna forma."
    "Seeing this meeting and how Eva feels more comfortable than she ever would have thought, fills you with joy."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2535
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_91a4b366:

    # "Después de lo que ha contado sobre su infancia... sí, como diría ella, te sientes como un idiota con ganas de protegerla."
    "After what she's told you about her childhood... Yes, as she would say, you feel like an idiot wanting to protect her."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2537
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_2516780d:

    # "Proteger. A Eva. La protectora. Quizás la tengas que proteger de cosas que ni siquiera sabe que existen. De las amenazas de una vida normal."
    "Protect. Eva. The protector. You may have to protect her from things she doesn't even know exist. From the threats of a normal life."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2538
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_be289a5c:

    # eri "Es especial, ¿verdad?"
    eri "She's special, isn't she?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2540
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a18e2524:

    # mc "¡Oh, [eri]! No te había visto. Estaba inmerso en mis pensamientos."
    mc "Oh, [eri]! I didn't see you come over. I was immersed in my thoughts."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2541
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_bbad04e8:

    # mc "Sí, lo es. Ha tenido una vida tan diferente de lo que estamos acostumbrados que llamarla especial es quedarse corto."
    mc "Yes, she is. She's had a life so different from what we're used to, that to call her special is an understatement."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2542
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_81778c0a:

    # eri "Cuando te has ido parecía un animalillo acorralado. Hasta que mi madre le ha dado un abrazo y..."
    eri "When you left, she looked like a cornered animal. Until my mother gave her a hug and..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2545
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a3f86bb8:

    # eri "Hasta cierto punto también es su madre, ¿no?"
    eri "To some extent she's also her mother, isn't she?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2547
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3c9b0d23:

    # eri "Mi madre..."
    eri "My mother..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2548
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_213694ad:

    # mc "¿Cómo ha ido La Conversación?"
    mc "How did The Conversation go?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2550
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8f8ae0f8:

    # eri "Aún la estoy asimilando. No sé como sentirme..."
    eri "I'm still processing it. I don't know how to feel about it..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2552
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_9c448045:

    # eri "Saber que tengo una segunda gemela... y que perdí dos por el camino a quien nunca conoceré... es raro... y duro..."
    eri "Knowing that I have a second twin... and that I lost two along the way who I will never meet... it's weird... and hard..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2553
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_c102ed34:

    # eri "El mismo día que gano una hermana me entero que he perdido a dos."
    eri "The same day I gained one sister, I found out I've lost two."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2555
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_37872221:

    # eri "Pero he ganado una hermana y ganaré una prima esta noche. No me puedo quejar demasiado... ¿verdad?"
    eri "But I've won a sister and I'll win a cousin tonight. I can't complain too much... can I?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2557
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3bb3cddf:

    # eri "Saber que mi madre no es mi madre biológica... que no tengo madre biológica... es raro... y duro..."
    eri "Knowing that my mother is not my biological mother... that I don't have a biological mother... it's weird... and hard..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2558
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ea86602e:

    # eri "Mi madre siempre será mi madre. No importa que no lleve sus genes... pero es difícil de asimilar."
    eri "My mother will always be my mother. It doesn't matter that I don't carry her genes... but it's hard to stomach."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2560
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d0630f8b:

    # eri "Pero he ganado una hermana y no pienso perder a mi madre, con lo que, en el fondo, no me puedo quejar demasiado... ¿verdad?"
    eri "But I've gained a sister, and I don't plan to lose my mother, so, in the end, I can't complain too much... right?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2561
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5148d458:

    # mc "¿Un abrazo?"
    mc "A hug?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2562
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_389e215f:

    # eri "Sí, por favor..."
    eri "Yes, please..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2564
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d24d96d7:

    # "Os abrazáis en silencio durante unos minutos. Conoces lo suficientemente bien a [eri] como para saber que solo necesita el abrazo. No necesita, no quiere, que hables en ese momento."
    "You hug in silence for a few minutes. You know [eri] well enough to know that she just needs to be hugged. She doesn't need, doesn't want, any words at that moment."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2566
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d4bc4005:

    # eri "Ya está, gracias..."
    eri "That's it, thank you..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2567
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_03bcbd68:

    # mc "Ya sabes que me encanta abrazarte. No deberías dar las gracias por ello."
    mc "You know I love to hug you. You don't need to thank me for it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2570
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_baba7214:

    # eri "El día que no le de las gracias a mi novio por un abrazo..."
    eri "The day I don't thank my boyfriend for a hug..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2571
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_14ded962:

    # eri "Hablando de novios... mi madre me ha hablado de las pruebas de embarazo. Me gustaría hacérmela."
    eri "Speaking of boyfriends... my mother told me about the pregnancy tests. I'd like to take one."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2572
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_82f87563:

    # mc "Las tengo en mi habitación. Después de comer si quieres vamos a hacerla, y mañana sabremos el resultado."
    mc "I have them in my room. We can go and do it after lunch if you wish, and tomorrow we'll know the result."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2573
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_13ff2faa:

    # mc "¿Has notado algún síntoma?"
    mc "Have you noticed any symptoms?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2575
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a4814f99:

    # eri "No, pero me gustaría saber si mi novio me ha dejado embarazada el mismo día que me desvirgó. *Risita*"
    eri "No, but I would like to know if my boyfriend got me pregnant the same day he deflowered me. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2576
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_df33eba7:

    # mc "A mí también me gustaría. Eso sería casi un record, ¿no?"
    mc "I'd like that too. That would almost be a record, wouldn't it?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2577
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_6e5dd189:

    # eri "Entonces, cuando acabe la comida te secuestro y vamos a tu habitación. A solas."
    eri "Then, when the lunch is over, I'll kidnap you and we'll go to your room. Alone."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2578
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ebffbfc7:

    # eri "Ahora voy ir al lavabo y a volver con Eva antes de que [emm] le pregunte a cuanta gente ha matado. Hasta ahora, cielo."
    eri "Now I'm going to go to the washroom and get back to Eva before [emm] asks her how many people she's killed. See you, honey."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2579
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a84b9718:

    # mc "Hasta ahora, mi amor."
    mc "See you, my love."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2582
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_2d375889:

    # eri "Debería ir al lavabo y volver con Eva antes de que [emm] le pregunte a cuanta gente ha matado."
    eri "I should go to the washroom and go back with Eva before [emm] asks her how many people she's killed."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2583
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f16f0b17:

    # mc "Hasta ahora, [eri]."
    mc "See you, [eri]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2585
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d27faf05:

    # "Continúas comiendo mientras observas como se va desarrollando la reunión. Al cabo de un rato, [dap] y Scarlett se dirigen hacia ti."
    "You continue to eat as you watch the meeting unfold. After a while, [dap] and Scarlett make their way towards you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2587
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_525cc9aa:

    # mc "¿Qué tal, chicas?"
    mc "What's up, girls?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2588
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_790aa11e:

    # dap "Bien, Eva es fantástica."
    dap "Well, Eva is great."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2589
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5fd4bf20:

    # sca "Es muy divertida. Y tiene fijación en hacer bromas sobre ti."
    sca "She's a lot of fun. And she has a fixation on making jokes about you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2590
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a83f03fe:

    # dap "Nos ha explicado tu cacería del topo en las lecciones de hoy. *Risa*"
    dap "She explained to us your mole hunt in today's lessons. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2591
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_47633bb5:

    # mc "Y, aparte de eso..."
    mc "And, aside from that..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2593
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3fbff912:

    # dap "Aparte de eso... quiero ir a Aruba."
    dap " Aside from that... I want to go to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2594
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ce705018:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Por qué?"
    mc "What? Why?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2595
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f25d7f31:

    # dap "Bueno, ahora soy accionista de una empresa de tecnología punta. Quiero aprender todo lo posible sobre como funciona."
    dap "Well, I'm now a shareholder in a high-tech company. I want to learn as much as I can about how it works."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2596
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_1a25afb3:

    # dap "Incluso trabajar en NTR cuando acabe la carrera."
    dap "Even work at NTR when I finish my degree."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2598
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_71d808a4:

    # sca "A mí tampoco me importaría trabajar allí. Me encanta la medicina, pero no sé si estoy hecha para tratar con pacientes."
    sca "I wouldn't mind working there either. I love medicine, but I don't know if I'm cut out to deal with patients."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2599
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_4a04d38c:

    # sca "Espero que me contratéis para hacer investigación médica."
    sca "I hope you will hire me to do medical research."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2600
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_2be33e05:

    # mc "Chicas, esperad. Acabáis de enteraros que NTR existe y ya estáis pensando en cambiar vuestros planes de futuro."
    mc "Girls, wait. You just found out NTR exists and you're already thinking about changing your future plans?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2602
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0e2731a9:

    # dap "Es lógico hacerlo. Las circunstancias han cambiado y es una oportunidad increíble."
    dap "It makes sense to do it. Circumstances have changed and it's an unbelievable opportunity."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2603
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_681ec9ba:

    # sca "No es cambiar los planes, sino adaptarlos a la nueva realidad. Clonación, nuevos dispositivos médicos... es el sueño de cualquier investigador."
    sca "It's not about changing plans, but about adapting them to a new reality. Cloning, new medical devices... it's every researcher's dream."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2604
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_7b9baae8:

    # dap "Y una legislación que no pone demasiados impedimentos." (multiple=2)
    dap "And a legislation that does not put too many impediments in your way." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2605
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_37efe932:

    # sca "En un pais donde todo eso es legal." (multiple=2)
    sca "In a country where all of that is legal." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2606
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_46a6680d:

    # mc "Por suerte os quedan años para acabar vuestras carreras... aún os quedan meses para empezarla..."
    mc "Luckily, you have years left to finish your degrees... you still have months left to start them..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2607
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a071d4be:

    # mc "Aparte de eso, ¿como ha ido La Conversación?"
    mc "Other than that, how did The Conversation work out?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2609
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_c31717ed:

    # dap "Ha sido extraño. Saber que mi madre... y el resto... nos habéis ocultado algo tan importante como esto..."
    dap "It was strange. To know that my mother... and the rest of you... have kept something as important as that from us..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2612
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a4c92c6a:

    # dap "Una empresa de tecnología punta, clonación, espionaje, secuestros... ¡Me encanta! Pero me hubiera gustado saberlo antes."
    dap "A cutting-edge technology company, cloning, espionage, kidnapping... I love it! But I would have liked to have known about it earlier."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2614
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_dbe632d6:

    # dap "Creía que [eri] y yo éramos adoptadas. Ahora resulta que somos clones de Eva. ¡Mola mucho más!"
    dap "I thought [eri] and I were adopted. Now it turns out we're Eva clones - so much cooler!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2615
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_1cc99e46:

    # dap "Y tener a Eva delante es como mirarse en un espejo. Un espejo más musculoso de lo que yo nunca seré, pero un espejo."
    dap "And having Eva in front of me is like looking in a mirror. A more muscular mirror than I will ever be, but a mirror."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2617
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0b68b1b2:

    # dap "Sé que los genes no tienen nada que ver en cómo somos, aparte de físicamente, pero llevo toda la comida estudiándola esperando que reaccione de una forma... o ponga una expresión..."
    dap "I know genes have nothing to do with how we are, other than physically, but I've been studying her the whole lunch waiting for her to react in a way... or put on a face..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2618
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_4006a498:

    # dap "Y la mayoría de veces actúa de una forma distinta de como lo haría yo."
    dap "And most of the time she acts differently than I would."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2620
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d7401d97:

    # sca "Es raro ver como crece la familia. Y más aún creciendo de esta forma."
    sca "It's odd to see the family grow. And even more so growing in this way."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2621
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f864bf12:

    # sca "No todos los días te enteras de que la clonación humana existe, ni de que tu mejor amiga es accionista de una empresa que la lleva a cabo."
    sca "It's not every day that you learn that human cloning exists, or that your best friend is a shareholder in a company that performs it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2622
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_65956472:

    # mc "Últimamente están pasando muchas cosas, y aún pueden pasar muchas cosas con la empresa."
    mc "There's a lot going on lately, and a lot can still happen with the company."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2625
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_738fa1d3:

    # dap "Hablando de la empresa... Mi madre me ha dicho que tienes unos test de embarazo especiales, por si alguna vez los necesito... desde la semana pasada sabe que tengo novio..."
    dap "Speaking about the company... My mother told me you have some special pregnancy tests, in case I ever need them... since last week, she knows I have a boyfriend..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2626
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_55a2125c:

    # mc "Sí, los tengo, pero aún no los puedes usar. Tienen que pasar 48 horas, con lo que hasta esta noche o mañana no van a servir."
    mc "Yes, I have them, but you can't use them yet. It should be 48 hours after sex, so they won't work until tonight or tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2627
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_99cd6460:

    # dap "Mejor mañana entonces. Así aseguramos el resultado si me dejaste embarazada al segundo intento."
    dap "Better tomorrow then. That way we'll ensure the result if you got me pregnant on the second try."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2630
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_2024531d:

    # sca "¿Dos? ¿La misma noche? Yo no tuve tanta suerte..."
    sca "Two? The same night? I wasn't so lucky..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2631
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8e3562a6:

    # mc "Tú no me dejaste quedarme a dormir. *Risa* ¿Tú también quieres hacerte la prueba?"
    mc "You didn't let me stay over. *Laugh* Do you want to get tested too?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2633
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_e1318a12:

    # sca "Sí. Puedo esperar a hacerla mañana con [dap]."
    sca "Yes. But I can wait to do it tomorrow with [dap]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2634
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f36560a9:

    # mc "Perfecto entonces. Mañana llevo un par de pruebas a vuestra habitación."
    mc "Perfect then. I'll bring a couple of tests to your room tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2636
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fe2ab8d2:

    # dap "¿Te imaginas que nos quedáramos embarazadas a la vez? Por cierto, me he pedido Maeve si es niña. *Risita*"
    dap "Can you imagine if we got pregnant at the same time? By the way, I've called dibs on Maeve if it's a girl. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2637
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_57835088:

    # sca "Yo aún no he pensado en nombres... la próxima vez que esté a solas con mi novio lo hablaremos. *Risita*"
    sca "I haven't thought about names yet... next time I'm alone with my boyfriend we'll talk about it. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2640
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fc8a8deb:

    # sca "¿Te imaginas que te quedaras embarazada en tu primera cita? *Risita* "
    sca "Can you imagine if you got pregnant on your first date? *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2641
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f48016d0:

    # dap "Si es de [mc] me da lo mismo que sea en la primera o en la tercera. *Risita*"
    dap "If it's [mc]'s, I don't care if it's on the first or the third date. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2643
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3d7a8a28:

    # mc "Hablando de pasar cosas... Scarlett, tenemos unas pruebas de embarazo especiales, por si quieres hacerte la prueba."
    mc "Speaking of things going on... Scarlett, we have some special pregnancy tests, if you want to take them."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2645
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ac94068e:

    # sca "Pero se necesitan 15 días o así para que sean efectivas, ¿no?"
    sca "But it takes 15 days or so for them to be effective, right?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2646
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_e947d54f:

    # mc "No con estas. 48 horas después del sexo. Con lo que ya te las podrías hacer y tener el resultado mañana. Si quieres."
    mc "Not with these. 48 hours after sex. So you could already take it, and we'll have the result tomorrow. If you want."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2648
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_7c05c25b:

    # sca "Si, quiero. *Risita* Ahora parece que me hayas pedido matrimonio. ¿Te va bien que lo hagamos mañana por la mañana? Hoy estás muy ocupado..."
    sca "Yes, I do. *Giggle* Now it looks like you've asked me to marry you. Is it okay if we do it tomorrow morning? You will be very busy today..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2649
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3af1604d:

    # mc "Perfecto. Mañana te llevo el test a vuestra habitación."
    mc "Perfect. I'll bring the test to your room tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2651
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_07f080b3:

    # dap "¿Te imaginas que te quedaras embarazada en tu primera cita? *Risita* "
    dap "Can you imagine if you got pregnant on your first date? *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2652
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_9f27126b:

    # sca "Si es de [mc] me da lo mismo que sea en la primera o en la tercera. *Risita*"
    sca "If it's [mc]'s, I don't care if it's on the first or the third date. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2654
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_08595e82:

    # mc "[dap], ¿puedo hablar un momento a solas con Scarlett?"
    mc "[dap], may I have a moment alone with Scarlett?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2656
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a37bb8d0:

    # dap "Por supuesto, yo debo volver a mirarme en los ojos de Eva."
    dap "Of course, I must return to look at myself in Eva's eyes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2658
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_bb4f9a94:

    # sca "¿Pasa algo, [mc]?"
    sca "Is anything wrong, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2659
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a845c0c4:

    # mc "Le he preguntado a Amanda y a Eva por los tests de ADN, sin decirle para quien era, y Amanda me traerá uno esta noche. Por si quieres que lo hagamos."
    mc "I asked Amanda and Eva about the DNA tests, without telling her who it was for, and Amanda is bringing me one tonight. In case you want us to do it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2661
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a9cb68de:

    # sca "¡Sí! ¿Cuándo podríamos tener los resultados?"
    sca "Yes! When might we have the results?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2662
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ab5bab3f:

    # mc "Por lo que me ha dicho, el martes. No son de NTR, sino de un laboratorio de Atascadero."
    mc "From what she told me, on Tuesday. They are not from NTR, but from a lab in Atascadero."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2663
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0456b85d:

    # sca "¡Genial! Tengo muchas ganas de saber si lo que sospechamos es cierto. Y de poder contárselo a la familia."
    sca "Great! I'm really looking forward to finding out if what we suspect is true. And to be able to tell the family."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2664
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_707b74ba:

    # mc "A lo mejor no hay nada que contar."
    mc "Maybe there's nothing to tell."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2666
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_1c89d20c:

    # sca "Salga lo que salga... al menos saldremos de dudas."
    sca "Whatever the outcome... at least we'll know for sure."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2668
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_18317d0b:

    # sca "Lo podemos hacer mañana cuando hagamos el test de embarazo."
    sca "We can do it tomorrow when we do the pregnancy test."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2670
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5c7d69cb:

    # sca "Lo podemos hacer mañana por la mañana. Hoy va a haber mucho movimiento en casa. ¿Lo hacemos en mi habitación?"
    sca "We can do it tomorrow morning. It's going to be busy at home today - shall we do it in my room?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2671
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fc41272f:

    # mc "¿Con [dap]? ¿Qué le vamos a contar?"
    mc "With [dap] around? What are we going to tell her?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2673
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_32eb378b:

    # sca "Es posible... que se me escapara el otro día... sabe que existe la posibilidad de que haya encontrado a mi padre."
    sca "It's possible... that I let it slip the other day... she knows there's a chance I might have found my father."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2674
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_c52156df:

    # mc "Scarlett, dijimos de guardarlo en secreto hasta no tener confirmación."
    mc "Scarlett, we agreed to keep it a secret until we had confirmation."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2675
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8d4e5d35:

    # sca "Lo sé, pero estaba muy emocionada, y [dap] me conoce demasiado bien. Preguntó y no quería mentirle. Pero no le he dicho quién podría ser."
    sca "I know, but I was very excited, and [dap] knows me too well. She asked and I didn't want to lie to her. But I didn't tell her who it might be."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2676
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_e0c92f79:

    # mc "Te entiendo. Cada vez odio más los secretos. Entonces, mañana en tu habitación."
    mc "I understand... I hate secrets more and more every minute. So, tomorrow in your room."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2678
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ab1adc1c:

    # sca "Sí, mañana en mi habitación. Te voy a dejar y a volver con Eva. No te gires, pero [emm] lleva un rato mirando en esta dirección, como si quisiera hablar contigo."
    sca "Yes, tomorrow in my room. I'm going to leave you and go back to Eva. Don't turn around, but [emm] has been looking in this direction for a while, like she wants to talk to you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2679
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_db33957c:

    # sca "Creo que necesitáis hablar. No gritéis mucho. No se ha tomado muy bien las noticias."
    sca "I think you need to talk. Don't yell too much. She hasn't taken the news very well."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2681
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5f502bfd:

    # sca "No te gires, pero [emm] lleva un rato mirando en esta dirección, como si quisiera hablar contigo."
    sca "Don't turn around, but [emm] has been looking in this direction for a while, like she wants to talk to you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2682
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_07863757:

    # dap "Creo que os vamos a dejar para que habléis. No gritéis mucho. No se ha tomado muy bien las noticias."
    dap "I think we're going to leave you two to talk. Don't yell too much. She hasn't taken the news very well."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2683
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3060c416:

    # mc "OK. Me da un poco de miedo. Esconde los cuchillos."
    mc "OK. It's a little scary. Hide the knives."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2684
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ef771bce:

    # sca "Acaban de llegar Kate, Debbie, y Saira... Es una buena oportunidad para presentarles a Eva."
    sca "Kate, Debbie, and Saira just arrived... It's a good time to introduce them to Eva."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2686
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_6d00e267:

    # emm "Sabes que hoy te odio, ¿verdad?"
    emm "You know I hate you today, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2687
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_df6f92ce:

    # mc "Me lo imagino. Pero yo no tengo la culpa, [emm]."
    mc "I can imagine. But I'm not to blame, [emm]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2688
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_cd617eb8:

    # emm "Tú tienes la culpa de no habérmelo explicado antes."
    emm "It's your fault for not explaining it to me sooner."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2689
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_2faba497:

    # mc "No podía hacerlo, [emm]. Tenía que ser Mamá."
    mc "I couldn't do it, [emm]. It had to be Mom."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2692
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_b2bb31ae:

    # emm "No puedo creer que, sabiendo lo que sabíais anoche, no me lo dijeráis."
    emm "I don't believe that, knowing what you knew last night and you didn't tell me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2694
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0166e0bd:

    # emm "¡Joder! Yo creía que eramos una familia y que no tenía que haber secretos."
    emm "Fuck! I thought we were a family and there were supposed to be no secrets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2696
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_e3ea68ec:

    # emm "*Susurrando* Yo pensando que estaba teniendo una sesión de sexo con mi hermano y mi madre y resulta que son dos desconocidos. Y todo por guardar secretos."
    emm "*Whispering* I thought I was having a sex session with my brother and mother, and it turns out they're two strangers. And all for keeping secrets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2698
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_bbf612b0:

    # mc "Hemos tenido secretos desde que estamos juntos. Tú guardaste en secreto que sabías lo mío con Mamá. ¿Sólo importan los secretos cuando eres tú quien no los sabe?"
    mc "We've had secrets since we've been together. You kept it a secret that you knew about me and Mom. Do secrets only matter when you're the one who doesn't know them?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2699
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ef8ad7f9:

    # mc "Y Mamá quería tener una conversación a solas contigo hoy. Ayer estaba muy afectada por todo esto. ¿Por qué crees que pasó ayer precisamente?"
    mc "And Mom wanted to have a conversation alone with you today. She was very distressed about all this yesterday - why do you think it happened yesterday?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2702
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f1a34bc8:

    # emm "No puedo creer que, sabiendo lo que sabías, no me lo dijeráis."
    emm "I don't believe that, knowing what you knew and you didn't tell me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2704
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_2edefc34:

    # emm "¡Joder! Yo creía que eramos una familia y que no tenía que haber secretos. *Susurrando* ¡Y eres mi novio!"
    emm "Fuck! I thought we were a family and we were supposed to have no secrets. *Whispering* And you're my boyfriend!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2706
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_51f985ac:

    # emm "Yo pensando que me estaba acostando con mi hermano y resulta que era un desconocido. Y todo por guardar secretos."
    emm " I thought I was sleeping with my brother, and it turns out he is a stranger. And all for keeping secrets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2708
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_76213b79:

    # mc "Hemos tenido secretos desde que estamos juntos. ¿O le has contado lo nuestro a alguien sin que se te escapara? ¿Sólo importan los secretos cuando eres tú quien no los sabe?"
    mc "We've had secrets since we've been together. Or have you told anyone about us without letting it slip? Do secrets only matter when you're the one who doesn't know them?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2709
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3211e247:

    # mc "Y Mamá quería tener una conversación a solas contigo hoy. Ayer estaba muy afectada por todo esto."
    mc "And Mom wanted to have a conversation alone with you today. She was very distressed about all this yesterday."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2712
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f1a34bc8_1:

    # emm "No puedo creer que, sabiendo lo que sabías, no me lo dijeráis."
    emm "I don't believe that, knowing what you knew and you didn't tell me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2714
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0166e0bd_1:

    # emm "¡Joder! Yo creía que eramos una familia y que no tenía que haber secretos."
    emm "Fuck! I thought we were a family and we were supposed to have no secrets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2716
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_4c5e15c0:

    # emm "Yo pensando que me tenía una familia y resulta que eran unos desconocidos. Y todo por guardar secretos."
    emm "I thought I had a family, and it turns out they are strangers. And all for keeping secrets."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2718
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_99b78c4b:

    # mc "Hemos tenido secretos desde siempre. ¿O le has contado a alguien que me besaste al volver del Twins? ¿Sólo importan los secretos cuando eres tú quien no los sabe?"
    mc "We've had secrets forever. Or have you told anyone that you kissed me when we got back from Twins? Do secrets only matter when you're the one who doesn't know them?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2719
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3211e247_1:

    # mc "Y Mamá quería tener una conversación a solas contigo hoy. Ayer estaba muy afectada por todo esto."
    mc "And Mom wanted to have a conversation alone with you today. She was very distressed about all this yesterday."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2721
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f4c1e79c:

    # emm "¿Afectada por qué? ¿Porque su secreto se iba a la mierda?"
    emm "Distressed by what? Because her secret was falling apart?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2722
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_19edf872:

    # mc "No, [emm]. Porque sabía lo que te podía afectar La Conversación. Porque sabía que te podías enfadar. Yo intenté convencerla de que has madurado, de que ya eres adulta."
    mc "No, [emm]. Because she knew how The Conversation could affect you. Because she knew you might get angry. I tried to convince her that you've matured, that you're an adult now."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2723
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_c413a301:

    # mc "Pero veo que me equivoqué."
    mc "But I can see I was wrong."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2726
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8b630532:

    # emm "¡Ahora resulta que no soy adulta! Sois vosotros los que vais con secretos y la que no es adulta soy yo. *Susurrando* Para follar contigo soy adulta, pero para saber esto no."
    emm "Now it turns out that I'm not an adult! It's you guys who go around with secrets and the one who's not an adult is me? *Whispering* I'm an adult to fuck with you, but I'm not to know this?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2728
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_66d743b2:

    # emm "¡Ahora resulta que no soy adulta! Sois vosotros los que vais con secretos y la que no es adulta soy yo."
    emm "Now it turns out that I'm not an adult! It's you guys who go around with secrets and the one who's not an adult is me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2729
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fee11b3b:

    # mc "[emm], yo siempre te he considerado una adulta desde que volví. Te lo he demostrado. *Susurrando* Y el sexo no tiene nada que ver."
    mc "[emm], I have always considered you an adult since I came back. I've proven that to you. *Whispering* And sex has nothing to do with it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2731
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3530d5a6:

    # mc "Vale, sí. Hay una empresa y hay un clon tuyo por ahí. ¿Qué ibas a hacer con esa información? Imágína que te lo hubiéramos dicho hace cuatro años."
    mc "Okay, yes. There's a company and there's a clone of you out there. What were you going to do with that information? Imagine if we had told you that four years ago."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2733
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_35067ce4:

    # mc "Y por eso te lo ha contado ahora. Por entonces ni siquiera sabíamos que Amanda existía. Solo que Mamá y Tía [nor] tenían acciones de la empresa que fundaron nuestros tíos."
    mc "And that's why she told you now. Back then we didn't even know Amanda existed. Only that Mom and Auntie [nor] owned shares in the company our uncles founded."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2735
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a466527e:

    # mc "Vale, sí. Hay una empresa y eres el clon de Amanda. ¿Qué ibas a hacer con esa información? Imágína que te lo hubiéramos dicho hace cuatro años."
    mc "Okay, yes. There's a company and you're Amanda's clone. What were you going to do with that information? Imagine if we had told you that four years ago."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2737
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0942aa08:

    # mc "Y por eso te lo ha contado ahora. Por entonces ni siquiera sabíamos que Amanda existía. Sabíamos que eras un clon, pero no de quién."
    mc "And that's why she told you now. Back then we didn't even know Amanda existed. We knew you were a clone, but not of whom."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2739
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_1cf3d603:

    # emm "¡Pero hace casi una semana que sabéis lo de Amanda y Eva!"
    emm "But you've known about Amanda and Eva for almost a week!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2740
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ed018052:

    # mc "Cuatro días. Y no estábamos seguros del todo. Mamá vió a Amanda ayer por primera vez. Y te lo ha contado hoy. No le puedes pedir más."
    mc "Four days. And we weren't quite sure. Mom met Amanda yesterday for the first time. And she told you about it today. You can't ask her for more."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2742
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fc077648:

    # emm "No crees que estoy exagerando, ¿verdad?"
    emm "You don't think I'm overreacting, do you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2743
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_3fa1d457:

    # mc "Sabía que te ibas a enfadar, pero creo que sí, que lo estás exagerando."
    mc "I knew you were going to get upset, but yes, I think you're overreacting."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2745
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_345bd271:

    # mc "Yo tambén descubrí ayer que es posible que nuestros tíos fueran asesinados..."
    mc "I also found out yesterday that it is possible that our uncles were murdered..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2747
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_41f9646b:

    # mc "Tú has descubierto que eras un clon. Yo descubrí ayer que es posible que a mi madre biológica la asesinaran..."
    mc "You found out you were a clone. Yesterday, I found out that my biological mother may have been murdered..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2749
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0ceb94f2:

    # emm "¿Qué?"
    emm "What?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2750
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_12273dd4:

    # mc "Si Mamá no te lo ha dicho es porque no hay pruebas, pero Aaron, Amanda, y Eva piensan que el accidente de avión pudo ser un sabotaje."
    mc "If Mom hasn't told you, it's because there's no proof, but Aaron, Amanda, and Eva think the plane crash may have been a sabotage."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2751
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_4c10f7de:

    # emm "¡Eso es muy jodido! Yo estaba histérica porque pensaba que alguien nos quisiera matar. Con el accidente de avión lo consiguieron..."
    emm "That's so fucked up! I was freaking out because I thought someone wanted to kill us. With the plane crash, they succeeded..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2752
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ace30f5a:

    # mc "Ellos no tenían a Eva y a Amanda para protegerlos. Nosotros sí."
    mc "They didn't have Eva and Amanda to protect them. We do."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2754
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_cb7c35c7:

    # emm "Es diferente de lo que me había imaginado... Me imaginaba una [dap]... por alguna razón no me imaginaba que se pareciera a [eri]."
    emm "She's different from what I pictured... I imagined someone like [dap]... for some reason, I didn't imagine her to look like [eri]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2755
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_e4de96fb:

    # emm "Pero cuanto más hablo con ella, más me recuerda a alguien, y no sé a quien. Pero no es a [dap] ni a [eri]."
    emm "But the more I talk to her, the more she reminds me of someone, and I don't know who. But it's not [dap] or [eri]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2756
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_97645c33:

    # mc "Yo sé a quién te recuerda. Si en un par de días no lo has descubierto, te lo diré."
    mc "I know who she reminds you of. In a couple of days, if you haven't figured it out, I'll tell you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2758
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_abc4d74c:

    # emm "Pero me cae muy bien. Creo que podríamos ser amigas. Además tiene muy buen gusto, el top es precioso, aunque sea blanco."
    emm "But I like her a lot. I think we could be friends. Plus, she has very good taste, the top is lovely, even if it is white."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2759
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_6d3b4e42:

    # mc "Me ha preguntado si se ponía uno rosa para gustarte más. Estaba muy nerviosa por conoceros. Piensa que para ella también tiene que ser difícil."
    mc "She asked me if she wore pink, would it help to make you like her better. She was very nervous to meet all of you. You have to realize it must be hard for her, too."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2761
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_33814444:

    # emm "Me lo imagino. No ha querido contar mucho de ella misma, pero por lo que me ha contado Mamá..."
    emm "I can imagine. She hasn't told us much about herself, but from what Mom has told me..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2763
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_cc7c281d:

    # mcp "(Vuelve a ser Mamá...)"
    mcp "(She's Mom Again...)"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2764
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f528ecac:

    # mc "Ha tenido una vida que ninguno de nosotros desearíamos."
    mc " She has lived a life that none of us would wish for."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2766
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_81a195c7:

    # emm "Pero ahora que somos sus jefes, podemos dejarle hacer lo que quiera, ¿no? Que deje de ser una mercenaria, que tenga una vida más normal."
    emm "But now that we are her bosses, we can let her do whatever she wants, can't we? Let her stop being a mercenary, let her have a normal life."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2767
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_70aaa442:

    # mc "Si quiere, supongo que sí."
    mc "If she wants to, I guess so."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2768
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_148970db:

    # emm "Claro, si quiere."
    emm "Sure, if she wants to."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2770
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_a5baf386:

    # emm "Y ahora que somos ricos, ¿puedo comprarme un Ferarri rosa?"
    emm "And now that we're rich, can I buy a pink Ferrarini?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2771
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5751a753:

    # mc "*Risa* Aún no somos ricos, [emm]. Hay que decidir qué hacer con la empresa. Pero dejémoslo para otro día."
    mc "*Laugh* We're not rich yet, [emm]. We have to decide what to do with the company. But let's leave that for another day."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2773
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8f978b7c:

    # emm "Mira, nuestra invitada se acerca. Puede que nos haya oído hablar de ella."
    emm "Look, our guest is coming. She may have heard us talking about her."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2775
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_48ca2285:

    # eva "[emm], perdona si te interrumpo. ¿Puedo hablar con [mc] a solas un momento?"
    eva "[emm], sorry to interrupt. May I have a word with [mc] alone for a moment?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2777
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ab690064:

    # emm "Por supuesto. Tengo que ir a... disculparme con mi madre."
    emm "Of course. I have to go and... apologize to my mother."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2779
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_bc2e3fce:

    # eva "¿Me puedes sacar de aquí?"
    eva "Can you get me out of here?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2780
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_af52567e:

    # mc "¿Ya te han aburrido?"
    mc "Have they bored you yet?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2782
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_1e01afef:

    # eva "No, para nada. Pero se están portando todas tan bien conmigo... "
    eva "No, not at all. But they're all being so kind to me.... "

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2783
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fb6cead6:

    # eva "Necesito aire fresco. Creo que [nor] ha cortado muchas cebollas hoy en esta cocina."
    eva "I need fresh air. I think [nor] has cut a lot of onions today in this kitchen."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2784
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_759e2f5a:

    # mc "¿Cuánto tiempo te va a llevar retirar las cámaras?"
    mc "How long is it going to take you to remove the cameras?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2786
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_972238ff:

    # eva "Un par de horas, ¿por qué?"
    eva "A couple of hours, why?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2787
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_db46cab2:

    # mc "Ahí tienes tu excusa. Un par de horas para las cámaras, volver a la base para relevar a Amanda... Si no empiezas ahora no te va a dar tiempo de todo."
    mc "There's your excuse. A couple of hours for the cameras, back to base to relieve Amanda... If you don't start now, you're not going to have time for everything."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2788
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_9848e752:

    # eva "Tengo tiempo de sobras."
    eva "I have plenty of time."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2789
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_97bf5564:

    # mc "Pero yo no lo sabía hasta ahora mismo y nadie lo sabe. No sabemos donde está la base. Y, de momento, no sé si quieres que lo sepamos."
    mc "But I didn't know that until just now and nobody knows. We don't know where the base is. And, at the moment, I don't know if you want us to know."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2791
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_07be78d4:

    # eva "¡Jodido manipulador! *Risa*"
    eva "Fucking manipulator! *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2792
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_eca4b62c:

    # mc "Tú misma lo has dicho. No soy manipulador, protejo a mis chicas... de mis otras chicas. *Risa*"
    mc "You said it yourself. I'm not a manipulator, I protect my girls... from my other girls. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2794
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_2fef2240:

    # eva "{b}¿Qué?{/b} ¿Tus chicas? {b}¿Me consideras una de tus chicas?{/b}"
    eva "{b}What?{/b} Your girls? {b}Do you consider me one of your girls?{/b}"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2795
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_adfaedd6:

    # mc "Sí, Eva. Tú y Amanda sois unas de mis chicas... de nuestras chicas. No lo voy a volver a repetir más. Sois parte de esta familia."
    mc "Yes, Eva. You and Amanda are one of my girls... one of our girls. I'm not going to say it again. You are part of this family."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2797
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d5671cc3:

    # eva "Mmmm... vaaale..."
    eva "Mmmm... Okaaay..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2798
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0c3ae172:

    # eva "¿Por dónde quieres que empiece a retirar las cámaras?"
    eva "Where do you want me to start removing the cameras?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2799
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_4727d6fb:

    # mc "Puedes empezar por mi casa. Ahora mismo está vacía."
    mc "You can start at my house. It's empty right now."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2801
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f9170af1:

    # "Eva se despide de todo el mundo, prometiendo pasar de nuevo por la cocina antes de irse para despedirse de verdad."
    "Eva says goodbye to everyone, promising to stop by the kitchen again before leaving to really bid farewell."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2802
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5f1438bc:

    # "Nadie quiere que Eva se vaya, pero nadie quiere tener cámaras en su habitación. Difícil disyuntiva. A regañadientes, dejan que te lleves a Eva."
    "No one wants Eva to leave, but no one wants to have cameras in their bedrooms. Tough choice. Reluctantly, they let you take Eva."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2804
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_973cc815:

    # "Quedas con [eri] en 10 minutos en tu habitación para hacer el test."
    "You'll meet [eri] in 10 minutes in your room to take the test."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2806
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8525ed60:

    # eva "¡Phew! Ha sido intenso."
    eva "Phew! That was intense."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2807
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ee67543d:

    # mc "¿Peor de lo que creías?"
    mc "Worse than you thought?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2809
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_0dbf0260:

    # eva "¡Mucho mejor! Pero demasiado intenso."
    eva "Much better! But too intense."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2810
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_538a91a1:

    # mc "Me alegra que te lo hayas pasado bien."
    mc "I'm glad you had a good time."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2812
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_fd5b4c15:

    # eva "Tengo una pregunta..."
    eva "I have a question..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2813
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_1afe9f90:

    # mc "Dime."
    mc "Tell me."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2814
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_5b91a292:

    # eva "Has dicho que formamos parte de esta familia..."
    eva "You have said that Amanda and I are part of this family..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2815
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_494a6419:

    # mc "Sí."
    mc "Yes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2816
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_53522e63:

    # eva "¿Para todo?"
    eva "With all that it entails?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2817
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_6a1f62a4:

    # mc "Claro."
    mc "Of course."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2819
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_6db421fd:

    # eva "Buenos días, [mc]... o buenas tardes ya."
    eva "Good morning, [mc]... or good afternoon by now."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2820
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_d054dd06:

    # mc "¡Wow, Eva! ¿Lo decías por eso?"
    mc "Wow, Eva. Is this the reason you were asking that?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2822
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_ed8b1216:

    # eva "Si ellas pueden besar a mi primo cañón, o lo que seas, yo también."
    eva "If they can kiss my hot cousin, or whatever you are, so can I."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2823
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_8fc39dda:

    # mc "*Risa* Vamos a quitar las cámaras."
    mc "*Laugh* Let's start removing the cameras."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2825
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_f1b2346b:

    # "Acompañas a Eva a tu habitación, de donde saca un par de cámaras y un micrófono. Ella seguirá en solitario por la casa"
    "You escort Eva to your room, from where she retrieves a couple of cameras and a microphone. She will continue alone through the house."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2827
translate english c16s003_LunchWithEva_eb2435a6:

    # "[eri] llega unos minutos después y hacéis el test. Ahora solo queda esperar 24 horas para saber el resultado. Empiezas a estar ansioso."
    "[eri] arrives a few minutes later and she takes the test. Now all that's left is to wait for 24 hours to find out the result. You start to get anxious."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2830
translate english c16s003_Text1_54f0683b:

    # mc "¿Me puedes asegurar que la [emm] de hace cuatro años no iba a fanfarronear sobre ello? ¿Con lo que te gustaba ser el centro de atención?"
    mc "Can you guarantee that the [emm] from four years ago wasn't going to brag about it? With the way you loved being the center of attention?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2832
translate english c16s003_Text1_2a79e1d0:

    # emm "Seguramente lo hubiera hecho... pero ya no soy así."
    emm "I probably would have... but I'm not like that anymore."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2835
translate english c16s003_Text2_2af8d137:

    # emm "Y deja de llamarla Mamá. Es tan tu madre como la mía."
    emm "And stop calling her Mom. She's as much your mother as she is mine."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2836
translate english c16s003_Text2_4206b51f:

    # mc "[emm], Mamá sigue siendo Mamá, y tú sigues siendo mi hermana. Me da lo mismo no llevar los mismos genes que vosotras."
    mc "[emm], Mom is still Mom, and you are still my sister. I don't care if I don't carry the same genes as you two."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2839
translate english c16s004_DateWithMaddie_c8143cb3:

    # "Decides llamar a Maddie para retrasar la cita. No vas a poder llegar antes de que acabe la cena con Amanda."
    "You decide to call Maddie to delay the date. You're not going to be able to get there before Amanda's dinner is over."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2841
translate english c16s004_DateWithMaddie_ceba9ff4:

    # mc "Hola, Maddie. Tengo malas noticias."
    mc "Hi, Maddie. I have some bad news."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2844
translate english c16s004_DateWithMaddie_a2f426b2:

    # mad "Hola, guapo. Al final tienes que recoger a aquella chica, ¿verdad?"
    mad "Hey, handsome. You finally have to pick that girl up, haven't you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2845
translate english c16s004_DateWithMaddie_31169d8e:

    # mc "Sí, y además después hay una cena en mi casa a la que no puedo faltar."
    mc "Yes, and then there's a dinner at my house afterwards that I can't miss."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2847
translate english c16s004_DateWithMaddie_7530335a:

    # mad "Con lo que tendremos que pasar nuestra película a otro día... o anularla..."
    mad "So we'll have to move our movie night to another day... or cancel it..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2848
translate english c16s004_DateWithMaddie_28138b9e:

    # mc "Había pensado en pasarme al acabar la cena, si quieres."
    mc "I had thought about stopping by your house after dinner, if you'd like."

