    sai "I've been thinking, and I've decided that yes, I could accept an open relationship with you again."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2921
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutMegan_e3032c81:

    # sai "Pero con unas diferencias sobre lo que teníamos en Portland."
    sai "But with some differences from what we had in Portland."

