translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_f3295ca7:

    # sai "Sabes que no tenía muchas amigas en Portland..."
    sai "You know I didn't have a lot of girl-friends in Portland..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2972
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_56bcf030:

