translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_2a399634:

    # sai "Porque salía contigo. O teníamos la falsa relación abierta que teníamos, para ser más exactos."
    sai "Because I was dating you. Or we had the fake open relationship we had, to be more precise."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2979
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_a09ee97a:

    # sai "Muchas de las chicas que se me acercaban era porque querían saber si me importaría que intentaran algo contigo."
    sai "A lot of the lasses who approached me wanted to know if I would mind if they tested the waters with you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2980
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_3d3a40fa:

    # sai "Pese a que les decía que podían intentarlo, creo que se me debía notar en la cara que mentía. Es difícil que quisieran ser mis amigas después de eso."
    sai "Even though I told them they could try, I think it was evident on my face that I was lying. It was hard for them to want to be my friends after that."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2981
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_588e2975:

