    sai "It's one thing for you to be free to go out with whomever you want, but it's quite another for me to find them for you, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2984
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_eccf9a0e:

    # mc "Entiendo, pero ¿qué tiene que ver con esto?"
    mc "I understand, but what does it have to do with this?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2986
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_437a30d6:

    # sai "Que no quiero que se repita lo mismo aquí. Anoche estuvimos hablando mucho sobre ti. Me bombardearon a preguntas."
    sai "I don't want to repeat the same thing here. Last night we talked a lot about you. I was barraged with questions."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2987
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_9c717159:

    # sai "No fuiste el único tema de conversación, pero la mayoría de la conversación giró en torno a ti cuando supieron lo que teníamos en Portland."
    sai "You weren't the only topic of conversation, but most of the conversation revolved around you once they found out what we had in Portland."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2992
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_d75df251:

    # sai "A Debbie le gustas. No es que me haya dicho nada, pero se le nota."
    sai "Debbie likes you. Not that she's said anything to me, but you can tell."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2994
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_97078413:

    # mc "Creo que es muy tímida como para hablar de eso con nadie que no sea su hermana."
    mc "I think she's too shy to talk about it with anyone but her sister."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2996
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_c04f9297:

    # mc "No sé si le gusto de esa forma."
    mc "I don't know if she likes me that way."

