    # sai "No me extrañaría que te tirase los trastos en breve."
    sai "I wouldn't be surprised if she hit on you before long."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3002
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_56791744:

    # mc "Creo que le caigo bien, pero no sé si llegará a eso."
    mc "I think she likes me, but I don't know if it will come to that."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3006
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_58b2bed5:

    # sai "Lisa aún no ha decidido si le gustas o no. Al menos de esa forma. Anoche parecía que estaba luchando consigo misma cada vez que hacía una pregunta sobre ti."
    sai "Lisa still hasn't decided whether she likes you or not. At least in that way. Last night it looked like she was fighting against herself every time she asked a question about you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3007
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_80049e53:

    # sai "Creo que ha dejado al tal Anthony, si es que alguna vez han estado juntos, por ti."
    sai "I think she left that Anthony lad, if they were ever together, because of you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3008
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_6dfda06e:

    # mc "¿Lisa? Creo que te equivocas. Anthony no ha resultado ser lo que ella esperaba."
    mc "Lisa? I think you're wrong. Anthony hasn't turned out to be what she expected."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3012
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_349ef1fc:

    # sai "Diría que Kate siente curiosidad hacia ti. No sé si en plan romántico o es que no sabe dónde encajarte en su idea del mundo."
    sai "I'd say Kate is curious about you. I don't know if it's romantic or if she just doesn't know where you fit into her idea of the world."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3013
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_10400194:

    # mc "Creo que te equivocas respecto a Kate."
    mc "I think you have a misconception about Kate."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3014
translate english c16s004_ConvoSairaAboutGirls_317dacfe:

