# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3137
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_d52ab70f:

    # mc "Pero volviendo al tema de la cena, ¿quieres que te lleve a la cena del Jazz Corner?"
    mc "But back to the dinner thing, do you want me to take you to the Jazz Corner dinner?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3139
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_1a1051a3:

    # meg "No hace falta. Parece que tienes un día muy ocupado hoy. Pediré un Unter para ir, y otro para volver cuando cerremos."
    meg "No need. Looks like you have a busy day today. I'll order an Unter to go, and another to come back when we close."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3140
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_d20119c8:

    # meg "No quiero despertar a nadie al volver, ni que tengas que quedarte despierto hasta tarde para recogerme."
    meg "I don't want to wake anyone when I get back, or that you have to stay up late to pick me up."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3141
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_483e268d:

    # mc "Bueno... sobre lo de despertar a alguien..."
    mc "Well... about waking someone up..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3142
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_90ed5b3c:

    # mc "Ha habido un pequeño problema logístico con las camas. Puedes dormir en mi habitación o en la de Saira."
    mc "There has been a small logistical problem with the beds. You can sleep in my room or Saira's room."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3144
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_c2b571c1:

    # meg "¿Saira? ¿Tu Saira de Portland?"
    meg "Saira? Your Saira from Portland?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3145
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_5a2352f5:

    # mc "Claro, tú no lo sabes. Sí, está haciendo un curso de verano aquí."
    mc "Oh, right, you don't know. Yes, she's taking a summer course here."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3148
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_a3a6e20f:

    # meg "¿Saira está aquí? ¿volvéis a estar juntos? ¿Cómo nos deja eso a nosotros?"
    meg "Is Saira here? Are you back together? How does that leave us?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3149
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_48ff20d3:

    # mc "Megan, que esté o no con Saira no afecta a cómo estemos tú y yo. Yo estoy contigo y ninguna otra mujer va a cambiar eso. Sea quién sea."
    mc "Megan, whether or not I'm with Saira doesn't affect what we have. I'm with you and no other woman is going to change that. Whoever she is."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3151
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_b90364a8:

    # meg "Me quitas un peso de encima. Por un momento he pensado que... no sé..."
    meg "You lift a weight off my chest. For a moment I thought that... I don't know..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3153
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_69510d4b:

    # meg "Si a eso le sumas lo de tu madre... ¿Cuándo crees que sería un buen momento para hablar con tu madre? Ya sabes... sobre nosotros... y vosotros..."
    meg "If you add your mother to that... When do you think would be a good time to talk to your mom? You know... about us... and you..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3154
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_e83e8012:

    # mc "Seguramente mañana. Hoy tú vas justa de tiempo y ella estará ocupada preparando la cena para Amanda. Es la primera vez que viene a cenar."
    mc "Probably tomorrow. You're on a tight schedule today, and she'll be busy cooking dinner for Amanda. It's the first time she's coming for dinner."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3156
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_d7553f4e:

    # meg "Creo que es lógico. Amanda es la que es igual que tu hermana, ¿no? Tiene que ser difícil para tu madre. Y emotivo."
    meg "I think it's logical. Amanda's the one who's just like your sister, right? It's got to be hard for your mom. And emotional."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3157
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_03f1791a:

    # mc "Lo es. Más emotivo que difícil. Para ella es como conocer a una hija con la que no ha tenido contacto nunca."
    mc "It is. More emotional than hard. For her, it's like meeting a daughter she's never had contact with."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3159
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_12b52c47:

    # meg "Sobre lo de la habitación, creo que será mejor que no duerma contigo en su casa hasta que no hable con ella. Me quedaré con Saira si a ella no le importa."
    meg "About the room thing, I think I'd better not sleep with you at her place until I talk to her. I'll stay with Saira if she doesn't mind."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3160
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_04742302:

    # mc "*Risa* No le importa, ya se lo he preguntado. Siempre le caíste bien. Y en mi habitación ibas a estar sola. Yo iba a dormir en algún sofá."
    mc "*Laugh* She doesn't mind, I've already asked her. She always liked you. And you would have been alone in my room. I was going to sleep on some couch."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3161
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_45f5cf1a:

    # mc "Creo que tenéis que hablar antes de que tú y yo podamos dormir juntos en casa."
    mc "I think you two need to talk before you and I can sleep at home together."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3163
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_ca2a7d3a:

    # mc "No te preocupes, me gustas mucho y eso no va a cambiar."
    mc "Don't worry, I really like you and that's not going to change."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3165
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_7ba64c70:

    # meg "Creo que será mejor que no duerma contigo hasta que no hable con ella. Me quedaré con Saira si a ella no le importa."
    meg "I think I'd better not sleep with you until I talk to her. I'll stay with Saira if she doesn't mind."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3166
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_04742302_1:

    # mc "*Risa* No le importa, ya se lo he preguntado. Siempre le caíste bien. Y en mi habitación ibas a estar sola. Yo iba a dormir en algún sofá."
    mc "*Laugh* She doesn't mind, I've already asked her. She always liked you. And you would have been alone in my room. I was going to sleep on some couch."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3167
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_dcb1b23a:

    # mc "Creo que será bueno que os pongáis al día."
    mc "I think it will be good for you to catch up."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3169
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_bd04d5e6:

    # mc "Hay otro tema del que te quería hablar. ¿Has sentido algún tipo de molestias últimamente?"
    mc "There's another topic I wanted to talk to you about - have you been feeling any discomfort recently?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3171
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_7a591752:

    # meg "¿Qué tipo de molestias? No me digas que tienes herpes o alguna cosa así."
    meg "What kind of discomfort? Don't tell me you have herpes or something."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3172
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_a67d12d7:

    # mc "No, me refería a si... habías tenido algún síntoma de malestar, vómitos, pezones sensibles... esas cosas."
    mc "No, I mean, have you... have you had any symptoms of discomfort, vomiting, sensitive nipples?... that sort of thing."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3174
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_11deb28a:

    # meg "¿Te preocupa haberme dejado embarazada?"
    meg "Are you worried you got me pregnant?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3175
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_f657f693:

    # mc "No, no me preocupa. Si estoy contigo y llega un crío no voy a tener ningún problema con ello. Pero..."
    mc "No, I'm not worried. If I'm with you and a kid comes from it, I'm not going to have an issue with it. But..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3176
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_3956db8f:

    # "Le explicas a Megan lo de los tests de embarazo. Su cara de sorpresa cuando acabas lo dice todo."
    "You explain to Megan all about the pregnancy tests. Her look of disbelief when you're done says it all."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3178
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_9143c8d7:

    # meg "Primero clones y ahora tests de embarazo sacados de una novela de ciencia ficción. ¿Estás seguro de que no me estás tomando el pelo?"
    meg "First clones, and now pregnancy tests straight out of a science fiction novel - are you sure you're not pulling my leg?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3179
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_9ad2b51e:

    # mc "Segurísimo. Los tengo en mi habitación, por si quieres hacerlo."
    mc "Absolutely. I have them in my room, if you want to use one."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3181
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_8ff8fa3d:

    # meg "Lo haré. Ayer me levanté con el estómago revuelto, pero no vomité y hoy estaba bien. No tengo ningún otro síntoma, con lo que podría ser cualquier cosa que me sentara mal."
    meg "I will. Yesterday I woke up with an upset stomach, but I didn't throw up and I was fine today. I don't have any other symptoms, so it could be anything that was making me sick."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3182
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_677c0cdb:

    # meg "Pero ahora que has sacado el tema... es mejor asegurarnos, ¿no?"
    meg "But now that you've brought it up... we better play it safe, right?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3183
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_b1276180:

    # mc "Yo pienso lo mismo. Podemos hacerlo cuando lleguemos, así tendremos el resultado mañana."
    mc "I think so too. We can do it when we get there, so we'll have the result tomorrow."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3185
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_54100d7d:

    # meg "Genial. ¿Queda mucho para llegar a tu casa?"
    meg "Great. How much longer to your house?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3186
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_e85d201e:

    # mc "Un par de minutos tan solo."
    mc "Just a couple of minutes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3187
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_0a895dbd:

    # meg "¿Puedes parar aquí un momento?"
    meg "Can you stop here for a moment?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3188
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_a43de5ba:

    # mc "¿Aquí?"
    mc "Here?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3189
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_75c7aa2f:

    # meg "Sí. Y baja del coche."
    meg "Yes. And get out of the car."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3191
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_b016fe8e:

    # meg "Quiero besarte antes de llegar a tu casa."
    meg "I want to kiss you before we reach your house."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3193
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_10fb3111:

    # meg "Creo que sería una falta de respeto hacerlo allí antes de hablar con tu madre."
    meg "I think it would be disrespectful to do it there before talking to your mother."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3195
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_232d7dea:

    # meg "Creo que sería una falta de respeto hacerlo allí antes de hablar con Saira."
    meg "I think it would be disrespectful to do it there before talking to Saira."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3196
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_65b9dd02:

    # mc "Nunca voy a rechazar un beso tuyo. Ven aquí"
    mc "I'm never going to refuse a kiss from you. Come here."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3198
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_d04c9ad6:

    # "Hace muchos días que no os habéis visto y las ganas de besaros se notan. El beso de la parada de autobús no ha sido suficiente para saciar el hambre que sentís el uno por el otro."
    "It's been many days since you've seen each other and the desire to kiss is evident. The kiss at the bus stop wasn't enough to satisfy the hunger you feel for each other."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3200
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_829d5225:

    # meg "Voy a echar de menos besarte."
    meg "I'm going to miss kissing you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3201
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_b16570fc:

    # mc "Sobre eso... hay una costumbre especial en mi casa. *Risa* Todo el mundo me besa como saludo."
    mc "About that... there's a special custom in my house. *Laugh* Everyone kisses me as a greeting."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3203
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_f872246a:

    # meg "¿Qué? ¿Incluso tu abuela?"
    meg "What? Even your grandma?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3204
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_0476d042:

    # mc "Bueno, todo empezó porque mi tía abuela quería tocarle los huevos a mi abuela. Al final todo el mundo que quiere me besa los buenos días y las buenas noches."
    mc "Well, it all started because my great-aunt wanted to mess with my grandmother. In the end, everyone who wants to kiss me good morning and good night does it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3205
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_091f2616:

    # mc "Nada que ver con como nos acabamos de besar, pero te lo digo para que no te sorprendas."
    mc "Nothing to do with how we just kissed, but I'm telling you, so you won't be surprised."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3207
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_ca5c3c9a:

    # meg "Creo que voy a tardar en acostumbrarme a tu familia. *Risa* Sois muy raros..."
    meg "I think it's going to take me a while to get used to your family. *Laugh* You guys are so weird..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3208
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_cde1225c:

    # mc "Yo prefiero decir especiales. ¿Vamos?"
    mc "I prefer to say unique instead of weird. Shall we?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3211
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_f73b3160:

    # meg "Creo que será mejor que no duerma contigo. Me quedaré con Saira si a ella no le importa."
    meg "I think I'd better not sleep with you. I'll stay with Saira if she doesn't mind."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3212
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_04742302_2:

    # mc "*Risa* No le importa, ya se lo he preguntado. Siempre le caíste bien. Y en mi habitación ibas a estar sola. Yo iba a dormir en algún sofá."
    mc "*Laugh* She doesn't care, I've already asked her. She always liked you. And you would have been alone in my room. I was going to sleep on some couch."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3213
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_c69290f6:

    # mc "Lo de dormir en mi habitación no era ninguna proposición. *Risa*"
    mc "The sleeping in my room thing was no proposition. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3215
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_54100d7d_1:

    # meg "Genial. ¿Queda mucho para llegar a tu casa?"
    meg "Great. How much longer to your house?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3216
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_e85d201e_1:

    # mc "Un par de minutos tan solo."
    mc "Just a couple of minutes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3218
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_c10e9c62:

    # "Llegáis a casa y haces las presentaciones. Cuando [emm] se entera de que Megan es cantante profesional, no puede evitar pedirle una canción."
    "You get home and make the introductions. When [emm] learns that Megan is a professional singer, she can't help but ask her for a song."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3219
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_87689677:

    # "Un minuto después ya está planeando una visita al Jazz Corner."
    "One minute later she's already planning a visit to the Jazz Corner."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3221
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_17775c77:

    # "Después de dejar su maleta en la habitación de Saira, subes con Megan a tu habitación con la excusa de enseñarle la casa. Aprovecháis para extraer una gota de sangre y ponerla en el test de embarazo."
    "After leaving her suitcase in Saira's room, you go up to your room with Megan with the excuse of showing her around the house. You take the opportunity to draw a drop of blood and put it on the pregnancy test."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3222
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_e08268b2:

    # "Poco rato después Megan tiene que irse al Jazz Corner para la cena con sus compañeros."
    "A short time later Megan has to go to Jazz Corner for dinner with her co-workers."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3223
translate english c16s005_PickUpMegan_e6ac3a70:

    # "Eva ya se ha ido después de quitar todas las cámaras de las habitaciones. Se ha despedido de todo el mundo antes de irse. ¿Le estará pillando el gusto a los abrazos?"
    "Eva has already left after removing all the cameras from the bedrooms and bathrooms. She said goodbye to everyone before leaving. Is she getting the hang of hugging?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3226
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_f8651efb:

    # "Al poco rato, escuchas un zumbido en el armario donde tienes guardada la prueba de embarazo de [mar]. Debe significar que ya esta, ¿no? Pero aún faltan 28 minutos."
    "After a short while, you hear a buzzing in the closet where [mar]'s left her pregnancy. That must mean it's done, right? But it's still 28 minutes until it will be 24 hours."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3227
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_a2f9f500:

    # "No te atreves a abrir el armario. Si ha acabado y las luces están encendidas sabrías el resultado. Quieres estar con [mar] cuando lo sepas."
    "You don't dare open the closet. If it's over and the lights are on you would know the outcome. You want to be with [mar] when you find out."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3228
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_03ff7bea:

    # "Decides ir a buscarla. Es mejor esperar los 28 minutos con ella."
    "You decide to go get her. It's better to wait those 28 minutes with her."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3229
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_e14f3613:

    # "27 minutos."
    "27 minutes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3231
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_8286151a:

    # "La encuentras en la planta de las estudiantes, paseando de un lado a otro, visíblemente nerviosa."
    "You find her on the students' floor, pacing back and forth, visibly nervous."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3232
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_5bad49d0:

    # mc "¿Qué haces aquí, [mar.mc!t]?"
    mc "What are you doing here, [mar.mc!t]?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3234
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_1eea780f:

    # mom "Haciendo tiempo para que llegue la hora. No me puedo concentrar en la cocina. Por suerte, casi todo lo que necesito para la cena de Amanda ya está hecho o acabándose de hacer."
    mom "Killing time before I had to go to your room. I can't concentrate in the kitchen. Luckily, almost everything I need for Amanda's dinner is already done or is just finishing up."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3235
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_4aa7f103:

    # mom "No quería subir a tu habitación para no contagiarte los nervios..."
    mom "I didn't want to go up to your room so as not to give you the jitters..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3236
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_1893bc5f:

    # mc "Yo bajaba a buscarte... Acaba de zumbar el aparato."
    mc "I was coming down to get you.... The device just buzzed."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3238
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_a7c67588:

    # mom "Pero aún faltan... 25 minutos..."
    mom "But there are still... 25 minutes left..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3239
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_b5b6f1b8:

    # mc "A lo mejor las 24 horas no son exactas. Sería raro que algo así tardara 24 horas justas."
    mc "Maybe this 24-hour thing is not exact. It would be odd for something like that to take 24 hours exactly."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3240
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_cd93664e:

    # mc "¿Subimos a comprobarlo? Si aún no está, podemos esperar juntos."
    mc "Shall we go upstairs and check? If it's not ready yet, we can wait together."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3242
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_72d4d124:

    # mom "Sí, por favor. Los nervios me están consumiendo."
    mom "Yes, please. Jitters are consuming me."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3244
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_1661e5d9:

    # "24 minutos."
    "24 minutes."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3246
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_17de5028:

    # mc "¿Preparada?"
    mc "Ready?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3247
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_49d974f0:

    # mom "¡Abre esa puñetera puerta de una vez!"
    mom "Open that goddamn door at once!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3249
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_9225fed3:

    # "Abrir la puerta te cuesta un mundo. Cada centímetro es un paso más hacia la confirmación o la negación de que vas a ser padre. De que [mar] lleva un hijo tuyo dentro."
    "Opening the door costs you a world. Every inch is a step closer to confirming or denying that you are going to be a father. That [mar] is pregnant with your child."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3253
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_b4d929db:

    # "Cada uno de esos centímetros ha valido la pena. La luz está verde."
    "Every one of those inches was worth it. Both lights are green."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3255
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_6a4910b6:

    # mom "¡Sí! ¿Eso significa que...?"
    mom "Yes! Does that mean that...?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3256
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_32508cee:

    # mc "¡Sí! ¡Estamos embarazados!"
    mc "Yes! We're pregnant!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3258
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_ae04c9ed:

    # mom "¡Sí! {b}¡Sí! ¡Genial!{/b}"
    mom "Yes! {b}Oh, yes! Great!{/b}"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3259
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_6c95156e:

    # mc "¿Contenta? ¡Yo no lo puedo estar más!"
    mc "Happy? I couldn't be happier!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3261
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_bbb7c08d:

    # mom "No te puedes imaginar cuánto."
    mom "You can't imagine how happy I am right now."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3263
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_9015e8b5:

    # mom "¡[emm] y tú vais a tener un hermano! Voy a ser la madre de los hijos del hombre más maravilloso del mundo."
    mom "You and [emm] are going to have a sibling! I'm going to be the most wonderful man in the world's children's mother."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3264
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_b2acaacb:

    # mc "*Risa* No le podré decir que falta el respeto a su padre si me llama Bro."
    mc "*Laugh* I won't be able to tell them that they disrespect their father if they call me Bro."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3266
translate english c16s006_MarPregnant_e3ea372f:

    # mom "¡Por fin voy a ser madre! Y voy a ser la madre de los hijos del hombre más maravilloso del mundo."
    mom "I'm finally going to be a mother! And I'm going to be the mother of the most wonderful man in the world's children."

