    nor "Fuck! I didn't even think about it! It buzzed and I picked it up to come and get you... It's still a few minutes before the 24-hour. Come in..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3387
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_939bc458:

    # mc "El de [mar.mc!t] también ha pitado antes."
    mc "[mar.mc!t]'s had also buzzed early."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3389
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_508fb12c:

    # nor "¿Lo habéis mirado? ¿Qué ha salido? Las dos estábamos muy nerviosas..."
    nor "Did you look at it? How did it turn out? We were both so nervous..."

