    mc "I won't, my love. But, for the sake of all that you love, open it now!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3426
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_77f0dd73:

    # nor "¡Verde! ¿Eso es un sí? ¿Estoy embarazada?"
    nor "Green! Is that a yes? Am I pregnant?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3427
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_df5cf238:

    # mc "Sí, mi amor. ¡Estamos embarazados!"
    mc "Yes, my love. We're pregnant!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3429
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_b1f56ee4:

    # "[nor] se lanza encima tuyo y te da un beso lleno de alegría y alivio a partes iguales."
    "[nor] throws herself on top of you and gives you a kiss filled with equal parts joy and relief."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3431
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_3af52d72:

    # nor "¡Felicidades, Papá!"
    nor "Congratulations, Daddy!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3432
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_17e7f44c:

    # mc "¡Felicidades, Mamá! ¿Contenta?"
    mc "Congratulations, Mommy! Happy?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3434
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_4ed246a8:

    # nor "Contenta, feliz, aliviada, entusiasmada, ilusionada... ¿Y tú?"
    nor " Happy, joyful, relieved, excited, thrilled... How about you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3435
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_6ab08d11:

    # mc "Lo mismo y un poco más. *Risa*"
    mc "The same and then some. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3438
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_f2b7d42a:

    # nor "No quiero sonar como una mala madre, pero las gemelas llegaron... por accidente. Ni Mike ni yo queríamos tener hijos en ese momento."
    nor "I don't want to sound like a bad mother, but the twins arrived... by accident. Neither Mike nor I wanted children at the time."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3441
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_69e95901:

    # nor "Cuando aquel test salió positivo fue algo inesperado. Este positivo ha sido deseado. Muy deseado. Estoy muy feliz ahora mismo."
    nor "When that test turned out positive it was unexpected. This positive test has been desired. Very much wished for. I'm very happy right now."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3442
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_7c2265b3:

    # nor "A mi edad no pensaba que fuera a volverme a pasar suceder nunca..."
    nor "At my age, I didn't think it would ever happen to me again...."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3445
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_9a797f4e:

    # nor "No quiero sonar como una mala madre, pero las gemelas llegaron... de una forma diferente."
    nor "I don't want to sound like a bad mother, but the twins arrived.... in a different way."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3448
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_4bf6cc33:

    # nor "Cuando llegaron a mi vida me enamoré de ellas inmediatamente. Pero con este test... me ha pasado lo mismo. ¡Voy a ser madre! ¡Estoy embarazada!"
    nor "When they came into my life I fell in love with them immediately. But with this test... the same thing happened to me. I'm going to be a mother! I'm pregnant!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3449
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_c7353256:

    # mc "Ya eres madre, mi amor. Ahora tan solo vas a tener que pasar por el embarazo."
    mc "You are already a mother, my love. Now you're just going to have to go through the pregnancy."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3451
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_909f3702:

    # nor "Ya sabes a lo que me refiero. A mi edad no pensaba que fuera a suceder nunca..."
    nor "You know what I mean. At my age I didn't think it would ever happen..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3452
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_339deede:

    # mc "Pues ha pasado. Ahora solo hay que cuidarte y mimarte. Espero no volver a verte acarrear dos neveras de camping nunca más. Pide ayuda."
    mc "Well, it happened. Now you just have to take care of yourself, and I'll pamper you. I hope I never see you hauling two coolers around ever again. Ask for help next time!"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3454
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_b2227a89:

    # nor "No lo volveré a hacer, no te preocupes. El problema va a ser el vino... con mi madre y Betty aquí..."
    nor "I won't do it again, don't worry. The problem is going to be the wine... with my mother and Betty here..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3455
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_c73cd744:

    # mc "¿El vino? ¿Necesitas vino para estar con ellas? Se están portando... relativamente bien."
    mc "The wine? Do you need wine to be with them? They're behaving... relatively speaking."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3457
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_1bb8ed9a:

    # nor "¡No! ¡No me refiero a eso! *Risa* Ahora que sé que estoy embarazada, no voy a beber vino, y van a sospechar. Especialmente Betty."
    nor "No! That's not what I mean! *Laugh* Now that I know I'm pregnant, I'm not going to drink wine, and they're going to get suspicious. Especially Betty."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3458
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_d7c96df5:

    # nor "El otro día en la playa se sorprendieron del cava sin alcohol. Pero tenía la excusa de que así las chicas podían brindar. Si compramos también vino sin alcohol..."
    nor "The day at the beach they were surprised by the non-alcoholic cava. But I had the excuse that the girls could toast with that. If we also buy non-alcoholic wine..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3459
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_89bc3ac2:

    # mc "Puedes decir que el alcohol te está haciendo ganar un poco de peso. Realmente vas a ganar peso. *Risa*"
    mc "You can say that alcohol is making you gain a little weight. Though, you're really going to gain weight now. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3461
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_2d9bffca:

    # nor "¿Te voy a tener que llamar Mr. Alcohol? *Risa* Puedes resultar igual de adictivo."
    nor " Should I call you Mr. Booze? *Laugh* You can turn out to be just as addictive."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3462
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_4e6e9df2:

    # mc "Puedes llamarme como quieras, mi amor."
    mc "You can call me whatever you want, my love."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3466
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_377aaa65:

    # nor "¡Rojo! Eso es un no, ¿verdad?"
    nor "Red! That's a no, right?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3467
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_d0acab7f:

    # mc "Sí, mi amor. No hemos tenido suerte."
    mc "Yes, my love. We weren't lucky."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3469
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_40b32f42:

    # nor "Bueno, me lo imaginaba... a mi edad no es fácil quedarse embarazada..."
    nor "Well, I figured... at my age it's not easy to get pregnant..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3470
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_7e0adbb5:

    # mc "¿A tu edad? [nor], aún eres joven, creo que tan solo tenemos que intentarlo más."
    mc "At your age? [nor], you're still young, I think we just need to try harder."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3472
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_e2464680:

    # nor "No, [mc], a mi edad se considera difícil, y aunque me quedara embarazada sería un embarazo de riesgo."
    nor "No, [mc], at my age it is considered difficult, and even if I were to get pregnant it would be a risky pregnancy."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3473
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_d49325de:

    # nor "Estaba muy ilusionada con este test, pero..."
    nor "I was really thrilled with this test, but..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3475
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_f2b7d42a_1:

    # nor "No quiero sonar como una mala madre, pero las gemelas llegaron... por accidente. Ni Mike ni yo queríamos tener hijos en ese momento."
    nor "I don't want to sound like a bad mother, but the twins arrived... by accident. Neither Mike nor I wanted children at the time."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3478
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_43c3fccc:

    # nor "Cuando aquel test salió positivo fue algo inesperado. Pero deseaba que este también saliera positivo... lo deseaba mucho. Un bebe tuyo y mío."
    nor "When that test turned out positive, it was unexpected. But I wanted this one to show a green light... I wanted it so badly. A baby of yours and mine."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3479
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_8362186a:

    # nor "A mi edad estaba segura de que no iba a volver a pasarme... y no me he equivocado."
    nor "At my age I was sure it wouldn't happen to me again... and I wasn't wrong."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3481
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_9a797f4e_1:

    # nor "No quiero sonar como una mala madre, pero las gemelas llegaron... de una forma diferente."
    nor "I don't want to sound like a bad mother, but the twins arrived.... in a different way."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3484
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_8fa44193:

    # nor "Cuando llegaron a mi vida me enamoré de ellas inmediatamente. Pero deseaba que este saliera positivo... deseaba volver a enamorarme de un bebé. De un bebe tuyo y mío. Ser madre."
    nor "When they came into my life I fell in love with them immediately. But I wanted this one to turn out positive... I wanted to fall in love with a baby again. With a baby of yours and mine. To be a mother."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3485
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_528a1960:

    # mc "Ya eres madre, mi amor. Ahora tan solo tenemos que seguir intentándolo para que tengas que pasar por el embarazo."
    mc "You are already a mother, my love. Now we just have to keep trying so you can go through pregnancy."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3487
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_5ca9cd7c:

    # nor "Ya sabes a lo que me refiero. A mi edad no pensaba que fuera a suceder nunca... y no me he equivocado."
    nor "You know what I mean. At my age I didn't think it would ever happen... and I wasn't wrong."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3488
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_97a300cd:

    # mc "De momento no te has equivocado, pero voy a hacer todo lo posible para que te equivoques."
    mc "You're not wrong so far, but I'm going to do everything I can to ensure that you're wrong in the long run."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3490
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_396d4692:

    # nor "¿Puedes abrazarme?"
    nor "Can you hug me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3491
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_6aee5866:

    # mc "Por supuesto. Ven aquí."
    mc "Of course. Come here."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3496
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_da3213a4:

    # "Os abrazáis unos momentos en silencio. No hace falta decir nada. Las emociones son compartidas en ese instante."
    "You embrace in silence for a few moments. There is no need to say anything. You share the same emotions in that instant."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3499
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_2d3df94d:

    # nor "Me acabo de dar cuenta de que soy una egoísta."
    nor "I just realized I'm so self-centered."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3500
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_ce705018:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Por qué?"
    mc "What? Why?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3501
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_789161fe:

    # nor "Te he explicado cómo me ha hecho sentir que salga negativo... pero no he tenido la decencia de preguntarte cómo te sientes tú."
    nor "I've explained to you how the test turning out negative made me feel... but I haven't had the decency to ask you how do you feel."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3502
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_0ee233f6:

    # mc "Un poco decepcionado. Y triste."
    mc "A little disappointed. And sad."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3503
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_3f453fb3:

    # mc "Pero no por mí. Sino por cómo estás tú. No me gusta verte triste. Y antes de que lo intentes, aún me gustaría menos que fingieras no estarlo."
    mc "But not because of me. It is because of how you are feeling. I don't like to see you sad. And before you try, I'd like it even less if you pretended not to be."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3504
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_e0506560:

    # mc "Prefiero compartir tu tristeza a no saber de ella."
    mc "I'd rather share your sadness than not know about it."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3506
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_93646856:

    # nor "¿Entiendes ahora por qué me he enamorado de ti?"
    nor "Do you understand now why I fell in love with you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3507
translate english c16s007_NorPregnant_6fa17517:

    # "En ese momento suena tu teléfono. Ni siquiera un momento de tranquilidad en esta familia."
    "At that moment, your phone rings. Not even a peaceful moment in this family."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3510
translate english c16s007_Twins_0c78769e:

    # nor "Me alegra muchísimo de que pasara. Son lo mejor que me ha sucedido en mi vida. No te ofendas..."
    nor "I'm so glad it happened. They are the best thing that ever happened to me. No offense..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3512
translate english c16s007_Twins_2ba857e8:

    # mc "No me ofendo. Ahora que tengo dos hijos en camino, entiendo perfectamente a lo que te refieres."
    mc "I take no offense. Now that I have two kids on the way, I completely understand what you mean."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3514
translate english c16s007_Twins_d8615c5d:

    # mc "No me ofendo. Ahora que tengo un hijo en camino, entiendo perfectamente a lo que te refieres."
    mc "I take no offense. Now that I have a child on the way, I completely understand what you mean."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3517
translate english c16s007_Twins2_0c78769e:

    # nor "Me alegra muchísimo de que pasara. Son lo mejor que me ha sucedido en mi vida. No te ofendas..."
    nor "I'm so glad it happened. They are the best thing that ever happened to me. No offense..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3518
translate english c16s007_Twins2_73376c40:

    # mc "No me ofendo. Sabiendo lo que sentía al pensar en ese test, entiendo perfectamente a lo que te refieres."
    mc "I take no offense. Knowing how I felt at the thought of that test, I completely understand what you mean."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3530
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_1be5424a:

    # mc "Dime, Amanda."
    mc "Hello, Amanda. Tell me."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3531
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_9db0953a:

    # ama "Siento molestarte, pero necesito tu ayuda."
    ama "I'm sorry to bother you, but I need your help."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3532
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_73b5442b:

    # mc "¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?"
    mc "What can I do for you?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3533
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_c9d4f219:

    # ama "He pinchado una rueda de la furgoneta y vestida así no puedo conducir la moto de Eva. ¿Puedes venir a buscarme?"
    ama "I have a flat tire on the van and, dressed like this, I can't ride Eva's bike. Can you come and get me?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3534
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_bd68f50a:

    # mc "Ningún problema ¿Dónde estás? Voy a buscarte."
    mc "No problem. Where are you? I'll come get you."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3535
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_fc60ee25:

    # ama "Te mando las coordenadas GPS..."
    ama "I'm sending you the GPS coordinates... .... ..."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3536
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_695671ed:

    # mc "¿Amanda?"
    mc "Amanda?"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3537
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_dd958d13:

    # ama "Gracias, [mc]."
    ama "Thanks, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3540
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_d7df3090:

    # mc "Amanda ha tenido una avería y tengo que ir a buscarla."
    mc "Amanda has punctured a wheel and I have to go get her."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3541
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_e186390b:

    # nor "Ve a por ella. No podemos tener una cena sin nuestra invitada."
    nor "Go get her. We can't have a dinner without our guest."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3542
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_4b182434:

    # mc "Te quiero. Te veo luego."
    mc "I love you. See you later."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3543
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_ea9faf0b:

    # nor "Yo también te quiero."
    nor "I love you too."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3546
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_d7df3090_1:

    # mc "Amanda ha tenido una avería y tengo que ir a buscarla."
    mc "Amanda has punctured a wheel and I have to go get her."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3547
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_4d0d8bd5:

    # mom "Ve a por ella. No podemos tener una cena sin nuestra invitada."
    mom "Go get her. We can't have a dinner without our guest."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3550
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_a5f4e56c:

    # "Antes de sacar el coche del garaje piensas que si el dormitorio y NTR no funcionan, te podrías ganar la vida como taxista."
    "Before you take the car out of the garage you think that, if the bedroom and NTR didn't exist, you could make a living as a cab driver."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3551
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_ddcb142e:

    # "Conduces hasta las coordenadas que te ha proporcionado Amanda. Tienes que conducir por un camino sin asfaltar que se interna en el bosque entre tu casa y la ciudad."
    "You follow the GPS indications to the coordinates provided by Amanda. You have to drive on an unpaved road that goes deep into the forest between your house and the city."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3552
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_7c8700e6:

    # mcp "(Parece que por fin voy a saber dónde está la base secreta.)"
    mcp "(Looks like I'm finally going to find out where the secret base is.)"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3553
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_bf00a854:

    # mcp "(Eso acaba de sonar a película de espías. Megan tenía razón.)"
    mcp "(That just sounded like a spy movie. Megan was right.)"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3555
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_cd4069e4:

    # "Por fin llegas a las coordenadas. Puedes ver la furgoneta y la vieja hacienda abandonada."
    "You finally arrive at the coordinates. You can see the van and the old, abandoned hacienda."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3556
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_38234c80:

    # "De crío venías aquí a jugar muchas veces. Estaba abandonada. Era como la casa encantada del bosque."
    "When you were a kid you used to come here to play a lot. It was abandoned. It was like a haunted house in the woods."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3557
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_0779c9ae:

    # "Sigue pareciendo abandonada, pero ahora sabes que no lo está."
    "It still looks abandoned, but now you know it's not."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3559
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_4bf61572:

    # "Bajas del coche tras tocar el claxon."
    "You get out of the car after honking the horn."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3560
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_d2759764:

    # mc "*Gritando* ¡Amanda! Ya estoy aquí."
    mc "*Yelling* Amanda! I'm here."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:3566
translate english c16s008_DinnerWithAmanda_aff72c72:

    # ama "Lo sé. Gracias por venir a buscarme."
    ama "I know, thank you for coming to get me."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:176
translate english c16s001_EmmaLessons_da4159dd:

    # "Después de eso se pasan la noche jugando al ajedrez. Sí, ajedrez para tres. Cosas más ridículas se han visto, como un gato en con el logo del desarrollador."
    "After that, they spend the night playing chess. Yes, chess for three. More ridiculous things have been seen, like a cat posing with the developer's logo."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:177
translate english c16s001_EmmaLessons_a1700e9d:

    # mcp "(Yo no recuerdo esto así, creo que hicimos algo diferente. Seguro que si pregunto en Discord alguien me lo recuerda. Me estoy cansando de jugar tanto al ajedrez.)"
    mcp "(I don't remember it like that, I think we did something different. I'm sure if I ask on Discord someone will remind me. I'm getting tired of playing chess so much.)"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1016
translate english c16s002_TakeMeemawDoc_2746ac1c:

    # "La doctora te indica como tienes que dar los masajes desde atrás."
    "The doctor tells you how you have to give the massages from behind."

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:1017
translate english c16s002_TakeMeemawDoc_e1413938:

    # mcp "(Hubiera sido más divertido verlo, pero este gato no se va de aquí. A lo mejor en Discord puedo preguntar cómo librarme de él.)"
    mcp "(It would have been more fun to watch it, but this cat won't leave. Maybe I can ask on Discord how to get rid of it.)"

# game/scripts/c16/c16.rpy:2379
translate english c16s003_ShootingLessons_c333b7a5:

    # mcp "(¿Otra vez este gato?)"
    mcp "(That cat again?)"

